(663659, 69531, 13336, '<td valign="top">since the window frame already has a border, adding one of your own is not needed, and in this case, since the window is slightly angled to the viewer, is distracting since it doesn''t match up.</td>', 'since the window frame already has a border, adding one of your own is not needed, and in this case, since the window is slightly angled to the viewer, is distracting since it doesn''t match up.', '2004-04-12 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
