(663666, 68624, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well taken. I like the texture and decay and the angle of view. The fade from right to left also is nice.</td>', 'Well taken. I like the texture and decay and the angle of view. The fade from right to left also is nice.', '2004-04-12 11:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(663667, 69488, 13336, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting shot, the three shapes play together nicely and the refletion is nice, especially the way the windows brake it up.<br/> <br/>it looks as though you ignored the lines that are happening in this image.  it owuld have made a stronger impression had you followed the lines of the clapboard, paralleled then to the top and bottom edges of the photo.  i should also point out that the brake in the top left corner and the reflection of what looks to be a white wall in the left window are distractions that, if avoidable, should not be present for maximum impact.</td>', 'this is an interesting shot, the three shapes play together nicely and the refletion is nice, especially the way the windows brake it up. it looks as though you ignored the lines that are happening in this image.  it owuld have made a stronger impression had you followed the lines of the clapboard, paralleled then to the top and bottom edges of the photo.  i should also point out that the brake in the top left corner and the reflection of what looks to be a white wall in the left window are distractions that, if avoidable, should not be present for maximum impact.', '2004-04-12 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(663668, 69518, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-04-12 11:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(663674, 69560, 14593, '<td valign="top">pretty view......looks like a place I may have traveled....different creative idea for a window...</td>', 'pretty view......looks like a place I may have traveled....different creative idea for a window...', '2004-04-12 11:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(663675, 69383, 4285, '<td valign="top">My only complaint is you didn''t include all the window frame. Otherwise great image.</td>', 'My only complaint is you didn''t include all the window frame. Otherwise great image.', '2004-04-12 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(663679, 69407, 4285, '<td valign="top">Has a painting feel to it. Very nice colours too. It is evident that it was taken through a window but I think a different composition could make the image stronger. As it is the window frame is distracting.</td>', 'Has a painting feel to it. Very nice colours too. It is evident that it was taken through a window but I think a different composition could make the image stronger. As it is the window frame is distracting.', '2004-04-12 11:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(663685, 69506, 4285, '<td valign="top">A little more rotation CCW would even it up; why go only part way? A lttle soft focused on the pier. Otherwise nice leading lines and great hues. Good capture.</td>', 'A little more rotation CCW would even it up; why go only part way? A lttle soft focused on the pier. Otherwise nice leading lines and great hues. Good capture.', '2004-04-12 11:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(663686, 69540, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this for about 15 minutes because it has so many different meanings. Is the viewer inside and denying entry to the person outside? Is the figure in the picture denying entry to everyone else? Light and dark. Good job!</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this for about 15 minutes because it has so many different meanings. Is the viewer inside and denying entry to the person outside? Is the figure in the picture denying entry to everyone else? Light and dark. Good job!', '2004-04-12 11:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(663693, 69323, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The stained glass in the blue colors really accents the view nicely, and the light coming in on the open half of the window panes is very pretty, too.  I''m not sure what to think of the actual view being out of focus, as opposed to the window itself, but since there''s nothing specifically out there except water, I think it''s enough of a view to give you the general impression of what you''re looking at, and that''s probably enough.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The stained glass in the blue colors really accents the view nicely, and the light coming in on the open half of the window panes is very pretty, too.  I''m not sure what to think of the actual view being out of focus, as opposed to the window itself, but since there''s nothing specifically out there except water, I think it''s enough of a view to give you the general impression of what you''re looking at, and that''s probably enough.', '2004-04-12 11:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(663697, 69560, 5391, '<td valign="top">Of course you are looking through the car window, and you can see a little bit of the edge of it in the lower right hand of the frame, but at first glance you percieve the mirror being the window, which doesn''t really fit with the theme of the challenge.  An interesting idea, nonetheless.</td>', 'Of course you are looking through the car window, and you can see a little bit of the edge of it in the lower right hand of the frame, but at first glance you percieve the mirror being the window, which doesn''t really fit with the theme of the challenge.  An interesting idea, nonetheless.', '2004-04-12 11:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(663698, 69407, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-04-12 11:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(663701, 69548, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and framing, creative shot.  The actual "window view" is a bit dreary and far less interesting than the girl, unfortunately.</td>', 'Nice composition and framing, creative shot.  The actual "window view" is a bit dreary and far less interesting than the girl, unfortunately.', '2004-04-12 11:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(663707, 69629, 5391, '<td valign="top">This would do well for the upcoming "silhouettes" challenge, too!  :)  Very nicely composed, kind of creepy!</td>', 'This would do well for the upcoming "silhouettes" challenge, too!  :)  Very nicely composed, kind of creepy!', '2004-04-12 11:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(663709, 69591, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very pretty view - the only improvement I''d suggest is taking the photo from straight on, standing in front of the center window.  Nice job with the exposure and city lights.</td>', 'Very pretty view - the only improvement I''d suggest is taking the photo from straight on, standing in front of the center window.  Nice job with the exposure and city lights.', '2004-04-12 11:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
