(663802, 68785, 14620, '<td valign="top">Really like your use of selective coloring here.  It really adds to the feel of the photo and gives it character.</td>', 'Really like your use of selective coloring here.  It really adds to the feel of the photo and gives it character.', '2004-04-12 13:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(663805, 68948, 7743, '<td valign="top">This was probably difficult to meter.  Unfortunately the chosen exposure has overexposed the moon.  With the moon you can use the sunny f16 rule to determine the correct exposure, that is f16 at 1/ISO for shutter speed.  This is only the starting point.  Adjust the aperture and shutter speed for the affect you want.</td>', 'This was probably difficult to meter.  Unfortunately the chosen exposure has overexposed the moon.  With the moon you can use the sunny f16 rule to determine the correct exposure, that is f16 at 1/ISO for shutter speed.  This is only the starting point.  Adjust the aperture and shutter speed for the affect you want.', '2004-04-12 13:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(663830, 69619, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.', '2004-04-12 14:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
