(664845, 68948, 14614, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot going for it -- composition is strong, pulls my eye through the frame right to left... borders compliment the colors well, moon thoughtfully positioned with an artisitc eye... a crisper moom would have gotten you a couple of extra points - as presented 6</td>', 'This shot has a lot going for it -- composition is strong, pulls my eye through the frame right to left... borders compliment the colors well, moon thoughtfully positioned with an artisitc eye... a crisper moom would have gotten you a couple of extra points - as presented 6', '2004-04-12 22:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
