(664850, 69506, 14614, '<td valign="top">lovely dual-tones, excellent use of the window as a natural frame as presented 8 (some things that would have boosted the score... crisper foreground - including the bird -- a nice element, the water''s edge right along the horizontal window but not quite divides the shot un-harmoniously (if that''s a word)</td>', 'lovely dual-tones, excellent use of the window as a natural frame as presented 8 (some things that would have boosted the score... crisper foreground - including the bird -- a nice element, the water''s edge right along the horizontal window but not quite divides the shot un-harmoniously (if that''s a word)', '2004-04-12 22:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(664852, 69312, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of what to show in your window -- would like to see the window crisper as it''s a bit distracting as the natural frame.  as presented one of my favorites this time 8</td>', 'Excellent choice of what to show in your window -- would like to see the window crisper as it''s a bit distracting as the natural frame.  as presented one of my favorites this time 8', '2004-04-12 22:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
