(665224, 69505, 3607, '<td valign="top">i don''t know if the pasture was out of focus because of a DOF thing or the dirt on the window, but if it was the first i think that if the field had been in better focus the photo might have been a bit stronger.  still, very cool find and setup.</td>', 'i don''t know if the pasture was out of focus because of a DOF thing or the dirt on the window, but if it was the first i think that if the field had been in better focus the photo might have been a bit stronger.  still, very cool find and setup.', '2004-04-13 02:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(665226, 68375, 3607, '<td valign="top">you know, you can buy a vent that will remove the steam and improve the transparancy.  also, i don''t get the red, it seems a bit out of place.</td>', 'you know, you can buy a vent that will remove the steam and improve the transparancy.  also, i don''t get the red, it seems a bit out of place.', '2004-04-13 02:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(665228, 69510, 3607, '<td valign="top">interesting capture.  maybe cropped a bit too close . . .</td>', 'interesting capture.  maybe cropped a bit too close . . .', '2004-04-13 02:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(665230, 69656, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nice shot - might have been more powerful if the silhouette was more in focus, but it still works very well.</td>', 'very nice shot - might have been more powerful if the silhouette was more in focus, but it still works very well.', '2004-04-13 02:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(665231, 69355, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. The white cross bars in the window go well with the flowers. Everything goes together nicely.</td>', 'Very nice picture. The white cross bars in the window go well with the flowers. Everything goes together nicely.', '2004-04-13 02:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(665234, 69550, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very emotive shot. I like the way the green is picked up in the water in the vase.</td>', 'Very emotive shot. I like the way the green is picked up in the water in the vase.', '2004-04-13 02:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(665235, 69621, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I''d really like to see how it looks in color.</td>', 'Very nice picture. I''d really like to see how it looks in color.', '2004-04-13 02:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(665236, 69134, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. It really has a haunting quality.</td>', 'Lovely picture. It really has a haunting quality.', '2004-04-13 02:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(665240, 69254, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is very interesting but very confusing, too. I had to look at it a long time to figure out what I think it is and even now, I''m not sure if I know what it is.</td>', 'Your picture is very interesting but very confusing, too. I had to look at it a long time to figure out what I think it is and even now, I''m not sure if I know what it is.', '2004-04-13 02:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(665243, 69681, 18552, '<td valign="top">The colors in your picture are really good. It''s a shame the window was so dirty.</td>', 'The colors in your picture are really good. It''s a shame the window was so dirty.', '2004-04-13 02:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(665245, 69531, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting window shot. The color and focus are really good. I think the picture might have looked less cluttered if you could have moved the piece of sheet metal out of the shot.</td>', 'Very interesting window shot. The color and focus are really good. I think the picture might have looked less cluttered if you could have moved the piece of sheet metal out of the shot.', '2004-04-13 02:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(665251, 69618, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2004-04-13 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(665253, 69308, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors work very well - but not much overall impact.</td>', 'The colors work very well - but not much overall impact.', '2004-04-13 02:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(665254, 69094, 18552, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t it be nice if everyone did see something this lovely out of their windows. Your picture is beautiful. To my eyes it looks a bit over saturated.</td>', 'Wouldn''t it be nice if everyone did see something this lovely out of their windows. Your picture is beautiful. To my eyes it looks a bit over saturated.', '2004-04-13 02:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(665255, 69407, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful seeing.  The rain and muted colors are exquisite.</td>', 'Wonderful seeing.  The rain and muted colors are exquisite.', '2004-04-13 02:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(665256, 69040, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is very lovely. I don''t quite understand why this is  "widow''s view"; did you mean "window''s view"?</td>', 'Your picture is very lovely. I don''t quite understand why this is  "widow''s view"; did you mean "window''s view"?', '2004-04-13 02:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(665258, 69611, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, very well composed and taken. To my eyes, the colors look a tiny bit over saturated.</td>', 'Lovely picture, very well composed and taken. To my eyes, the colors look a tiny bit over saturated.', '2004-04-13 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(665259, 69556, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white.  Wish the ray of light were a bit more prominent.</td>', 'Nice black and white.  Wish the ray of light were a bit more prominent.', '2004-04-13 02:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(665261, 69498, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perspective very unusual. Nice use of the contrasting colors and the dark background.</td>', 'Perspective very unusual. Nice use of the contrasting colors and the dark background.', '2004-04-13 02:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(665262, 68948, 19608, '<td valign="top">Composition and soft colors excellent.</td>', 'Composition and soft colors excellent.', '2004-04-13 02:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(665264, 69518, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great job in black and white.  Focus on the dog''s eyes and fur perfect.  The hint of water on the glass adds a great touch.</td>', 'Great job in black and white.  Focus on the dog''s eyes and fur perfect.  The hint of water on the glass adds a great touch.', '2004-04-13 02:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(665266, 69115, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this does nothing all all for me.</td>', 'Sorry but this does nothing all all for me.', '2004-04-13 02:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(665268, 68375, 19608, '<td valign="top">Bizarre.</td>', 'Bizarre.', '2004-04-13 02:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(665281, 69138, 19802, '<td valign="top">very nice...I love the flag in the background.</td>', 'very nice...I love the flag in the background.', '2004-04-13 02:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(665282, 69674, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice abstract...  I like the angle of the blinds and how the string divides the shot in half.</td>', 'Pretty nice abstract...  I like the angle of the blinds and how the string divides the shot in half.', '2004-04-13 02:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(665283, 69550, 18935, '<td valign="top">Nice mood.</td>', 'Nice mood.', '2004-04-13 02:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(665284, 69160, 4494, '<td valign="top">The window frame is barely noticable, but the rest of it (the view) is awesome!</td>', 'The window frame is barely noticable, but the rest of it (the view) is awesome!', '2004-04-13 02:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(665287, 69681, 4494, '<td valign="top">Should have tilted the pic to the left a few degrees so the peirs and window frame are level.  Pretty interesting shot, and nice colors.</td>', 'Should have tilted the pic to the left a few degrees so the peirs and window frame are level.  Pretty interesting shot, and nice colors.', '2004-04-13 02:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(665289, 69323, 4494, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea...  did you tweak the some of the squares in the window with Channel Mixer?  Excellent idea, it really makes the picture great.  The water color is a little "off" however, I think.  And the "outline" around the water kind of bothers me.</td>', 'Fantastic idea...  did you tweak the some of the squares in the window with Channel Mixer?  Excellent idea, it really makes the picture great.  The water color is a little "off" however, I think.  And the "outline" around the water kind of bothers me.', '2004-04-13 03:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(665290, 69621, 4494, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the toning is a little strong, but the subject, lighting, and framing, etc., is great.</td>', 'In my opinion the toning is a little strong, but the subject, lighting, and framing, etc., is great.', '2004-04-13 03:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(665291, 69624, 4494, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, I almost used this same Title.  Glad I didn''t. :)  Pretty insteresting shot.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Ohhh, I almost used this same Title.  Glad I didn''t. :)  Pretty insteresting shot.  Nice lighting.', '2004-04-13 03:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(665292, 69439, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks like you took the shot from the outside looking in?  If so, the stuff on the inside of the shot is kinda distracting.</td>', 'Looks like you took the shot from the outside looking in?  If so, the stuff on the inside of the shot is kinda distracting.', '2004-04-13 03:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(665296, 69472, 4494, '<td valign="top">There''s not much emphasis on on the subject which is supposed to be outside the window (the clouds in this case).  The great looking roof grabs the attention here.</td>', 'There''s not much emphasis on on the subject which is supposed to be outside the window (the clouds in this case).  The great looking roof grabs the attention here.', '2004-04-13 03:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(665301, 69630, 4494, '<td valign="top">The window frame isn''t clear enough in the shot.  Plus this shot is extremely tilted to the left.  The colors (especially the blues) are great however. :)</td>', 'The window frame isn''t clear enough in the shot.  Plus this shot is extremely tilted to the left.  The colors (especially the blues) are great however. :)', '2004-04-13 03:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(665303, 69582, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset but you should have zoomed in to leave out most of the kitchen area.  It''s hard to make this kind of window frame interesting however since there''s not much to it.</td>', 'Nice sunset but you should have zoomed in to leave out most of the kitchen area.  It''s hard to make this kind of window frame interesting however since there''s not much to it.', '2004-04-13 03:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(665305, 69236, 19608, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and execution.</td>', 'Clever idea and execution.', '2004-04-13 03:18:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(665307, 69256, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very good idea...  You should do a second shot but this time focus on the COOL window (the beveled glass and lead frame, etc.).  Imagine how much better that would look!  The focus does NOT have to be on the flowers at all here, and would serve as blurred color for the window frame. :)</td>', 'Very good idea...  You should do a second shot but this time focus on the COOL window (the beveled glass and lead frame, etc.).  Imagine how much better that would look!  The focus does NOT have to be on the flowers at all here, and would serve as blurred color for the window frame. :)', '2004-04-13 03:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(665308, 69644, 19608, '<td valign="top">Photo editing a bit off.  Areas around steering wheel and right side under windshield are booth detractors.</td>', 'Photo editing a bit off.  Areas around steering wheel and right side under windshield are booth detractors.', '2004-04-13 03:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(665309, 69641, 4494, '<td valign="top">I looks overly sharpened or something.  Or maybe the contrast is tweaked too much?</td>', 'I looks overly sharpened or something.  Or maybe the contrast is tweaked too much?', '2004-04-13 03:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(665310, 69580, 4494, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this so that there''s about 1 inch less on the top, and about 1/2 inch less on the sides.  Nice subjects.</td>', 'I would have cropped this so that there''s about 1 inch less on the top, and about 1/2 inch less on the sides.  Nice subjects.', '2004-04-13 03:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(665311, 69629, 19608, '<td valign="top">The subtle interior lighting and the sihlouette of the "peeping Tom" maske this one work very well.</td>', 'The subtle interior lighting and the sihlouette of the "peeping Tom" maske this one work very well.', '2004-04-13 03:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(665312, 69160, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice dogwoods.  Lighting reminds me of a Thomas Kincaid painting.  Window frame was mandatory, but missing.</td>', 'Nice dogwoods.  Lighting reminds me of a Thomas Kincaid painting.  Window frame was mandatory, but missing.', '2004-04-13 03:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(665313, 68414, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool image!!!  I love this one, except that:  There''s no window frame.  Otherwise it''s great.  You should clone out the reflections at the top of the shot and sell this one to train enthusiasts.</td>', 'Very cool image!!!  I love this one, except that:  There''s no window frame.  Otherwise it''s great.  You should clone out the reflections at the top of the shot and sell this one to train enthusiasts.', '2004-04-13 03:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(665314, 69506, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors are superb!</td>', 'Colors are superb!', '2004-04-13 03:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(665315, 69531, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the window frame.  The only [major] detractor for me is that terrible white sky.  It''s a shame since the other soft colors are so very nice.</td>', 'Very nice use of the window frame.  The only [major] detractor for me is that terrible white sky.  It''s a shame since the other soft colors are so very nice.', '2004-04-13 03:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(665316, 69544, 4494, '<td valign="top">I can see a reflection of a window.  Is this what you mean by "More Than Meets the Eye"?  The stuff on the left is kinda distracting.  Should have cropped that whole area out.</td>', 'I can see a reflection of a window.  Is this what you mean by "More Than Meets the Eye"?  The stuff on the left is kinda distracting.  Should have cropped that whole area out.', '2004-04-13 03:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(665318, 69639, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and very nice colors.</td>', 'Nice idea and very nice colors.', '2004-04-13 03:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(665319, 69671, 4494, '<td valign="top">You''re nuts!!!!   LOL!  If you look at this shot, it''s very well done.  Color, composition, focus, the subject beyond the "window",  is all perfect.  8.</td>', 'You''re nuts!!!!   LOL!  If you look at this shot, it''s very well done.  Color, composition, focus, the subject beyond the "window",  is all perfect.  8.', '2004-04-13 03:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(665321, 69611, 19608, '<td valign="top">A study in colors.  Well done.</td>', 'A study in colors.  Well done.', '2004-04-13 03:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(665322, 69512, 4494, '<td valign="top">The boat kinda ruins it because it''s clearly not the right size for the rest of the shot.  Should have left it out.</td>', 'The boat kinda ruins it because it''s clearly not the right size for the rest of the shot.  Should have left it out.', '2004-04-13 03:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(665323, 69677, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very noisy image.</td>', 'Very noisy image.', '2004-04-13 03:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(665325, 69644, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice theme here.  I like the way you''ve minimized the impact of the car parts, and keep the attention on the cool looking sign.</td>', 'Pretty nice theme here.  I like the way you''ve minimized the impact of the car parts, and keep the attention on the cool looking sign.', '2004-04-13 03:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(665326, 69510, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool.  I''m imagining how it''d look if you moved the camera down and to the left a little.</td>', 'Cool.  I''m imagining how it''d look if you moved the camera down and to the left a little.', '2004-04-13 03:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(665328, 69312, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nic eshot, really like this colours on the beach.</td>', 'Very nic eshot, really like this colours on the beach.', '2004-04-13 03:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(665330, 69216, 4494, '<td valign="top">The outside is over-exposed.  This is hard to get right sometimes when you have this large a difference on light to dark areas.  At least the kid is correctly exposed.  Thumbs up for that. :)</td>', 'The outside is over-exposed.  This is hard to get right sometimes when you have this large a difference on light to dark areas.  At least the kid is correctly exposed.  Thumbs up for that. :)', '2004-04-13 03:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(665331, 69535, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-) Would be a good entry on the Silhouettes challenge.<br/> <br/>I really like this, looks almost like a young girl looking outside(Hopefully if your model is a little older she will take that as a compliment.  The sepia toning is great, makes it feel like an older shot.  Well done!</td>', ':-) Would be a good entry on the Silhouettes challenge. I really like this, looks almost like a young girl looking outside(Hopefully if your model is a little older she will take that as a compliment.  The sepia toning is great, makes it feel like an older shot.  Well done!', '2004-04-13 03:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(665332, 69669, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  This is excellent..  Love the tone of the window frame.  8.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  This is excellent..  Love the tone of the window frame.  8.', '2004-04-13 03:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(665335, 68688, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love it.  This is an awesome abstract.  Love the colors and the black frame.  Lighting is perfect!  8.</td>', 'Love it.  This is an awesome abstract.  Love the colors and the black frame.  Lighting is perfect!  8.', '2004-04-13 03:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(665336, 68375, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wicked.   Great job on this.</td>', 'Wicked.   Great job on this.', '2004-04-13 03:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(665387, 69677, 16126, '<td valign="top">Very grainy, and the white bar at the bottom is distracting. Good composition.</td>', 'Very grainy, and the white bar at the bottom is distracting. Good composition.', '2004-04-13 05:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(665388, 69111, 16126, '<td valign="top">Interesting! I would have liked to see more of the cityscape, maybe with only 3 windows in the picture? Good take!</td>', 'Interesting! I would have liked to see more of the cityscape, maybe with only 3 windows in the picture? Good take!', '2004-04-13 05:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(665390, 69467, 16126, '<td valign="top">Cool! Being a perfectionist, I would have cropped the right a little bit more to make it symmetrical. Great picture!</td>', 'Cool! Being a perfectionist, I would have cropped the right a little bit more to make it symmetrical. Great picture!', '2004-04-13 05:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(665405, 69556, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice window, good contrasts and lighting.</td>', 'Nice window, good contrasts and lighting.', '2004-04-13 06:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(665412, 69472, 16126, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, good composition. 8</td>', 'Interesting colors, good composition. 8', '2004-04-13 06:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(665417, 68983, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Shame the front rose is out of focus, as it is the point the eyes go at first looking.</td>', 'Nice composition. Shame the front rose is out of focus, as it is the point the eyes go at first looking.', '2004-04-13 06:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(665418, 69540, 8139, '<td valign="top">This is a creative composition. The silhouette is suggestive and adds really to the photo.</td>', 'This is a creative composition. The silhouette is suggestive and adds really to the photo.', '2004-04-13 06:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(665419, 69257, 16126, '<td valign="top">Great composition, great colors, and the effect of the distortion is very nice! 9</td>', 'Great composition, great colors, and the effect of the distortion is very nice! 9', '2004-04-13 06:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(665420, 69395, 16126, '<td valign="top">Idea is nice, but the title suggests you need more light on the foreground</td>', 'Idea is nice, but the title suggests you need more light on the foreground', '2004-04-13 07:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(665421, 69145, 16126, '<td valign="top">The one doing the eyeing is hardly visible!</td>', 'The one doing the eyeing is hardly visible!', '2004-04-13 07:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
