(665503, 68871, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but the combination of the rectilinear border and the skewed window frame are distracting. I think you should expolore either squaring up the window, or removing the border.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but the combination of the rectilinear border and the skewed window frame are distracting. I think you should expolore either squaring up the window, or removing the border.', '2004-04-13 09:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
