(665629, 69547, 16745, '<td valign="top">wow......not only a fantastic shot, for me it pushes that feeling of exterestials....I wonder if the major streetlights could have been softened a bit to bring up the blue light  8</td>', 'wow......not only a fantastic shot, for me it pushes that feeling of exterestials....I wonder if the major streetlights could have been softened a bit to bring up the blue light  8', '2004-04-13 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(665632, 69621, 16745, '<td valign="top">I like this alot...for me it evokes olde times, herbs and a simple way of living..I wonder if the border on the left is a bit large, would there be more depth with a smaller window border...very well done</td>', 'I like this alot...for me it evokes olde times, herbs and a simple way of living..I wonder if the border on the left is a bit large, would there be more depth with a smaller window border...very well done', '2004-04-13 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(665633, 69669, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - one of my favorites of the challenge.  Very nicely, exactingly framed, and the dog looking in really adds something - gives you a subject that''s used well in conjunction with the window.  10</td>', 'Excellent shot - one of my favorites of the challenge.  Very nicely, exactingly framed, and the dog looking in really adds something - gives you a subject that''s used well in conjunction with the window.  10', '2004-04-13 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(665635, 69543, 16745, '<td valign="top">More than meets the eye, movement well done....wish there was a person in the car as you shot it.....excellent crop..  7</td>', 'More than meets the eye, movement well done....wish there was a person in the car as you shot it.....excellent crop..  7', '2004-04-13 11:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(665643, 68414, 5391, '<td valign="top">Whereas a lot of these shots seem to be taken from a window for no reason other than that''s what the challenge asked for, the window here actually serves a purpose.  Mixed with the motion blur, you really get the feeling you are riding in a train, and the lovely pastel tones make this image really work.  Great job!</td>', 'Whereas a lot of these shots seem to be taken from a window for no reason other than that''s what the challenge asked for, the window here actually serves a purpose.  Mixed with the motion blur, you really get the feeling you are riding in a train, and the lovely pastel tones make this image really work.  Great job!', '2004-04-13 12:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(665648, 69515, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice - the foreground, especially, adds a feeling of depth and texture.  Nice tones.</td>', 'Very nice - the foreground, especially, adds a feeling of depth and texture.  Nice tones.', '2004-04-13 12:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(665673, 69677, 5391, '<td valign="top">The pixelization really hurts this a lot.  Otherwise, good timing and framing.</td>', 'The pixelization really hurts this a lot.  Otherwise, good timing and framing.', '2004-04-13 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(665674, 68688, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative, lovely shot.  One of the most artistic of the challenge.  8</td>', 'Very creative, lovely shot.  One of the most artistic of the challenge.  8', '2004-04-13 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(665677, 69556, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is really a beatiful shot.  It bothers me just a bit that the subject is the flowers and those are enhanced by the windowlight, but there''s no real "window view" included.</td>', 'This is really a beatiful shot.  It bothers me just a bit that the subject is the flowers and those are enhanced by the windowlight, but there''s no real "window view" included.', '2004-04-13 12:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(665695, 69664, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice! I like this very much. But I feel its missing something. Maybe another person looking out the window with you. There seems to be a lot of space on the left. You were right not to crop it though, it would have been hard to tell you were looking out a window.  9</td>', 'Nice! I like this very much. But I feel its missing something. Maybe another person looking out the window with you. There seems to be a lot of space on the left. You were right not to crop it though, it would have been hard to tell you were looking out a window.  9', '2004-04-13 12:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(665697, 68873, 11843, '<td valign="top">You pervert!!! LOL<br/>JK<br/>Interesting interpretation of a window. 8</td>', 'You pervert!!! LOLJKInteresting interpretation of a window. 8', '2004-04-13 12:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
