(665727, 69658, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape view, but the window post distracts from the composition. Also, I think I would have cropped out the barbed wire.</td>', 'Nice landscape view, but the window post distracts from the composition. Also, I think I would have cropped out the barbed wire.', '2004-04-13 13:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(665729, 69611, 16126, '<td valign="top">Looks like tasty lemons! I feel the window a bit overpowering, maybe with different cropping or a different angle you could have made it more subtle.</td>', 'Looks like tasty lemons! I feel the window a bit overpowering, maybe with different cropping or a different angle you could have made it more subtle.', '2004-04-13 13:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(665732, 69588, 16126, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful tree, but the window reflections distract a lot from the impact of the photo. Maybe increasing the contrast would help. I''m not convinced that B&amp;W is an improvement, blossom should be colorful IMO.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful tree, but the window reflections distract a lot from the impact of the photo. Maybe increasing the contrast would help. I''m not convinced that B&W is an improvement, blossom should be colorful IMO.', '2004-04-13 13:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
