(665933, 68785, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the battered look of the van, and the picture poses a lot of questions in the viewer''s mind.  Who is this person?  Why is he using a laptop in the van?.  Nicely done. (8)</td>', 'I like the battered look of the van, and the picture poses a lot of questions in the viewer''s mind.  Who is this person?  Why is he using a laptop in the van?.  Nicely done. (8)', '2004-04-13 15:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(665934, 69630, 15495, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Is the water really that blue or is that a photoshop enhancement?</td>', 'Nice shot. Is the water really that blue or is that a photoshop enhancement?', '2004-04-13 15:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(665939, 69383, 15495, '<td valign="top">Nice .  Is that a reall window?</td>', 'Nice .  Is that a reall window?', '2004-04-13 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(665942, 69407, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the almost painterly quality of this, helped by the distortion form the glass.  I find the two closer branches (left of the window and about a third of the way along the bottom) a little distracting.  Otherwise a nice shot. (8)</td>', 'I like the almost painterly quality of this, helped by the distortion form the glass.  I find the two closer branches (left of the window and about a third of the way along the bottom) a little distracting.  Otherwise a nice shot. (8)', '2004-04-13 15:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(665951, 69505, 16879, '<td valign="top">Great character and textures here.  INteresting interpretation of the theme. (9)</td>', 'Great character and textures here.  INteresting interpretation of the theme. (9)', '2004-04-13 16:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(665954, 68505, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the variation in tone and texture here.  (8)</td>', 'I like the variation in tone and texture here.  (8)', '2004-04-13 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(665956, 68944, 16879, '<td valign="top">Nice blues and reds, but unfortunately the clouds / ground are not that interesting and it feels like it has been done before. (3)</td>', 'Nice blues and reds, but unfortunately the clouds / ground are not that interesting and it feels like it has been done before. (3)', '2004-04-13 16:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(665960, 69439, 16879, '<td valign="top">I see what you were aiming at with the lightning, but unfortunately there are just too many distractions.</td>', 'I see what you were aiming at with the lightning, but unfortunately there are just too many distractions.', '2004-04-13 16:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(665964, 69556, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, which has a great tonal range, but I''m niot sure it fits the ''...make it obvious it''s been taken from a window'' part of the brief. (6)</td>', 'I like the picture, which has a great tonal range, but I''m niot sure it fits the ''...make it obvious it''s been taken from a window'' part of the brief. (6)', '2004-04-13 16:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(665966, 68948, 19460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Was this an unexpected photo opportunity, or did you wait for the moon to be in that exact spot?</td>', 'Beautiful!  Was this an unexpected photo opportunity, or did you wait for the moon to be in that exact spot?', '2004-04-13 16:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(665968, 69145, 16879, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, but the exposure was clearly tricky here and I don''t feel the result is terribly successful as a result.</td>', 'A nice concept, but the exposure was clearly tricky here and I don''t feel the result is terribly successful as a result.', '2004-04-13 16:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(665972, 69505, 19460, '<td valign="top">For some reason this picture really touched me.  Reminds me of my grandpa''s backyard, the old truck back there.  I also commend you on your imaginative idea, looking through the window of this old truck, abandoned, is unique to the category.</td>', 'For some reason this picture really touched me.  Reminds me of my grandpa''s backyard, the old truck back there.  I also commend you on your imaginative idea, looking through the window of this old truck, abandoned, is unique to the category.', '2004-04-13 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(665973, 69669, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the dog''s expression, and good use of the blind to control the lighting. (7)</td>', 'I like the dog''s expression, and good use of the blind to control the lighting. (7)', '2004-04-13 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(665974, 69648, 19460, '<td valign="top">Great idea, unique and imaginative.  I also like the spots of bright color in this otherwise almost monochrome picture!</td>', 'Great idea, unique and imaginative.  I also like the spots of bright color in this otherwise almost monochrome picture!', '2004-04-13 16:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(665977, 69312, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition of the curves, but I find myself looking for a strong focal point every time I look a this, but I never quite find it. (5)</td>', 'I like the repetition of the curves, but I find myself looking for a strong focal point every time I look a this, but I never quite find it. (5)', '2004-04-13 16:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(665979, 69644, 19460, '<td valign="top">That is truly sad! I often complain about the loss of our drive-in theatres!  Great perspective and imaginative.</td>', 'That is truly sad! I often complain about the loss of our drive-in theatres!  Great perspective and imaginative.', '2004-04-13 16:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(665981, 68397, 16879, '<td valign="top">I love the look on the guy''s face, and it definitely has the feeling of ''work avoidance'' about it.  Nice, humourous shot. (7)</td>', 'I love the look on the guy''s face, and it definitely has the feeling of ''work avoidance'' about it.  Nice, humourous shot. (7)', '2004-04-13 16:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(665982, 69355, 19460, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasts here, even though the flowers are white, as well as the window frame, they still maintain their clarity and don''t blend at all.  Very beautiful greens.  Such detail in a photo with so few colors!!!</td>', 'I love the contrasts here, even though the flowers are white, as well as the window frame, they still maintain their clarity and don''t blend at all.  Very beautiful greens.  Such detail in a photo with so few colors!!!', '2004-04-13 16:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(665984, 69132, 16879, '<td valign="top">the window makes an intricate and interesting silhouette, and the crescent is nicely framed. (7)</td>', 'the window makes an intricate and interesting silhouette, and the crescent is nicely framed. (7)', '2004-04-13 16:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(665986, 69395, 19460, '<td valign="top">I want to go there!  I don''t know all of the proper terminology yet, but the way your picture transitions from the darker, more muted interior of the building, without losing any detail, to the brighter, busy outside of the window is amazing!!</td>', 'I want to go there!  I don''t know all of the proper terminology yet, but the way your picture transitions from the darker, more muted interior of the building, without losing any detail, to the brighter, busy outside of the window is amazing!!', '2004-04-13 16:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(665987, 69528, 19460, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful in its detail!!</td>', 'Very beautiful in its detail!!', '2004-04-13 16:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(665988, 69259, 19460, '<td valign="top">So imaginative and beautiful!</td>', 'So imaginative and beautiful!', '2004-04-13 16:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(665990, 69395, 16879, '<td valign="top">Nice lead-in lines from the table direct us through to the well-framed city skyline.  It''s a shame that the day was not sunny as this would have made the skyline more intersting and probably thrown some needed light into the foreground. (5)</td>', 'Nice lead-in lines from the table direct us through to the well-framed city skyline.  It''s a shame that the day was not sunny as this would have made the skyline more intersting and probably thrown some needed light into the foreground. (5)', '2004-04-13 16:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(665991, 69629, 19460, '<td valign="top">So scary!!! But very imaginative, great photo!</td>', 'So scary!!! But very imaginative, great photo!', '2004-04-13 16:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(665992, 68983, 19460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and serene.</td>', 'Beautiful and serene.', '2004-04-13 16:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(665993, 69624, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the execution of this picture - good exposuyre, and an interesting expression on the woman''s face. (6)</td>', 'I like the execution of this picture - good exposuyre, and an interesting expression on the woman''s face. (6)', '2004-04-13 16:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(665994, 69669, 19460, '<td valign="top">How cute! I was waiting for the page on my old computer to load and was not anticipating this at all when it finally loaded all the way.  I could see the title but had to wait for the rest of the picture.  I love it!</td>', 'How cute! I was waiting for the page on my old computer to load and was not anticipating this at all when it finally loaded all the way.  I could see the title but had to wait for the rest of the picture.  I love it!', '2004-04-13 16:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(665996, 69386, 16879, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the squirrel, but I think a tighter crop would have worked better.  I find the foreground very distracting. (4)</td>', 'Nice picture of the squirrel, but I think a tighter crop would have worked better.  I find the foreground very distracting. (4)', '2004-04-13 16:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(665997, 69619, 19460, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the window view is the reflection we are seeing on the far wall?  That''s my impression anyway and I think it''s great!  Very imaginative and unique!</td>', 'I''m assuming the window view is the reflection we are seeing on the far wall?  That''s my impression anyway and I think it''s great!  Very imaginative and unique!', '2004-04-13 16:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(665999, 69160, 16879, '<td valign="top">Nice light through the tress, and well captured. It feels a bit tilted to the right, though that may just be me. (6)</td>', 'Nice light through the tress, and well captured. It feels a bit tilted to the right, though that may just be me. (6)', '2004-04-13 16:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(666000, 68505, 19460, '<td valign="top">Cool.  That''s the one word I could come up with it as I sat looking at this photo, nodding my head and saying, "cool''.  The double window effect is awesome!</td>', 'Cool.  That''s the one word I could come up with it as I sat looking at this photo, nodding my head and saying, "cool''.  The double window effect is awesome!', '2004-04-13 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(666002, 69681, 19460, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I love it that the window is scratched and murky.  So much detail in every part of the photo.  I live in Washington state also, not too far from Bellevue.</td>', 'Great picture, I love it that the window is scratched and murky.  So much detail in every part of the photo.  I live in Washington state also, not too far from Bellevue.', '2004-04-13 16:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(666003, 69518, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is agreat shot, looiks good in B&amp;W, think it''ll look not as good in colour.I like that the window isn''t centred or parallel, the angled look add to the shot.  Great expression on the dog, nice clear eyes too.  Well done!</td>', 'This is agreat shot, looiks good in B&W, think it''ll look not as good in colour.I like that the window isn''t centred or parallel, the angled look add to the shot.  Great expression on the dog, nice clear eyes too.  Well done!', '2004-04-13 16:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(666005, 69323, 19460, '<td valign="top">This is so serene and calming.  Very beautiful.</td>', 'This is so serene and calming.  Very beautiful.', '2004-04-13 16:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(666006, 69550, 8610, '<td valign="top">To Dark IMO. good luck anyways</td>', 'To Dark IMO. good luck anyways', '2004-04-13 16:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(666010, 69160, 19460, '<td valign="top">How peaceful, I love your detail and contrasts.  I can''t wait to learn how to keep such detail while having the background so soft.  I''m very impressed.</td>', 'How peaceful, I love your detail and contrasts.  I can''t wait to learn how to keep such detail while having the background so soft.  I''m very impressed.', '2004-04-13 16:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(666011, 69236, 19460, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that the truth! I work at a middle school, much too beautiful of a day in your picture for school!  Excellent!</td>', 'Isn''t that the truth! I work at a middle school, much too beautiful of a day in your picture for school!  Excellent!', '2004-04-13 16:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(666013, 69618, 12802, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, really like this shot!!  Looks nice and smooth, and I like the colours in his eyes, well done!!</td>', 'Brilliant, really like this shot!!  Looks nice and smooth, and I like the colours in his eyes, well done!!', '2004-04-13 16:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(666014, 69111, 19460, '<td valign="top">That is awesome!  Very good idea and the clarity is amazing!</td>', 'That is awesome!  Very good idea and the clarity is amazing!', '2004-04-13 16:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(666023, 69678, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, almost horror film type with the dark figure...<br/> <br/>Great lighting, the slight graininess on the left hand side is great too!  Only bit, the sky showing through at the top of the trees could maybe have been clowed out? Seems a tiny wee bit overexposed?</td>', 'Nice shot, almost horror film type with the dark figure... Great lighting, the slight graininess on the left hand side is great too!  Only bit, the sky showing through at the top of the trees could maybe have been clowed out? Seems a tiny wee bit overexposed?', '2004-04-13 16:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(666026, 69510, 16879, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of the theme, and nice textures. (8)</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of the theme, and nice textures. (8)', '2004-04-13 16:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(666027, 69161, 16879, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot that tells a story. (7)</td>', 'Nice action shot that tells a story. (7)', '2004-04-13 16:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(666028, 68688, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes in te window frame and the mottled effect from the glass.  The curved frond seen through the glkass is a nice touch. (8)</td>', 'I like the shapes in te window frame and the mottled effect from the glass.  The curved frond seen through the glkass is a nice touch. (8)', '2004-04-13 16:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(666030, 69611, 19914, '<td valign="top">Hey! Where do you live? Spain? In Murcia, Alicante or Valencia? If so, I am VERY near to you.</td>', 'Hey! Where do you live? Spain? In Murcia, Alicante or Valencia? If so, I am VERY near to you.', '2004-04-13 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(666033, 69515, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and warm tones in this.</td>', 'I like the textures and warm tones in this.', '2004-04-13 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(666034, 68551, 16879, '<td valign="top">Interesting depiction of urban sprawl.</td>', 'Interesting depiction of urban sprawl.', '2004-04-13 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(666035, 69319, 16879, '<td valign="top">I like the cat''s expression, and the drops on the window are a nice touch.</td>', 'I like the cat''s expression, and the drops on the window are a nice touch.', '2004-04-13 16:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(666038, 69236, 16879, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, and a nicely balanced exposure.  I find the slope of the top of the window a little distracting, and there is too much foreground for my taste.</td>', 'An interesting idea, and a nicely balanced exposure.  I find the slope of the top of the window a little distracting, and there is too much foreground for my taste.', '2004-04-13 16:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(666041, 69040, 16879, '<td valign="top">The group of bottles on the left looks interesting, and I can''t help feeling the picture would have been more successful using just these, and a tigher crop of the window.  I find the dark pots in the middle and the cut-off bottle at the left distracting.</td>', 'The group of bottles on the left looks interesting, and I can''t help feeling the picture would have been more successful using just these, and a tigher crop of the window.  I find the dark pots in the middle and the cut-off bottle at the left distracting.', '2004-04-13 17:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(666064, 68820, 327, '<td valign="top">You know....this doesn''t appear to be windows. I''m sure it is, but looks like the bottom of a deck, bridge..? Sorry. I guess the body is there but the main house has been gone long enough for trees to grow. Maybe if you had been back farther and we could see more of the stucture.</td>', 'You know....this doesn''t appear to be windows. I''m sure it is, but looks like the bottom of a deck, bridge..? Sorry. I guess the body is there but the main house has been gone long enough for trees to grow. Maybe if you had been back farther and we could see more of the stucture.', '2004-04-13 17:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(666066, 69334, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this but do see it as a doo more then a window. Good colors, cop going by, gir, and good red on the VW. Not a bad entry.</td>', 'I like this but do see it as a doo more then a window. Good colors, cop going by, gir, and good red on the VW. Not a bad entry.', '2004-04-13 17:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(666067, 68551, 327, '<td valign="top">Just stunning. Where is that??</td>', 'Just stunning. Where is that??', '2004-04-13 17:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(666069, 69618, 327, '<td valign="top">?Lila...Soni this as all your work is a wonderful moment in time captured forever. Beautiful light and of course your daughter is also.</td>', '?Lila...Soni this as all your work is a wonderful moment in time captured forever. Beautiful light and of course your daughter is also.', '2004-04-13 17:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(666072, 69673, 327, '<td valign="top">Hey unique idea for the challenge. Maybe if you would of waited untill the view was a little more interesting? Just a though. Good luck.</td>', 'Hey unique idea for the challenge. Maybe if you would of waited untill the view was a little more interesting? Just a though. Good luck.', '2004-04-13 17:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(666074, 69498, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty roses, pretty color. They do look like a bouquet more then a rose bush. The light is good and the idea is good. Good luck.</td>', 'Pretty roses, pretty color. They do look like a bouquet more then a rose bush. The light is good and the idea is good. Good luck.', '2004-04-13 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(666075, 69582, 327, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a view. Well done, good colors</td>', 'Now that''s a view. Well done, good colors', '2004-04-13 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(666078, 69132, 327, '<td valign="top">Appealing tones, and of course the frames are so interesting. Beautiful view.</td>', 'Appealing tones, and of course the frames are so interesting. Beautiful view.', '2004-04-13 17:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(666100, 69675, 327, '<td valign="top">You mean Eighty? :{<br/>Nice reflection but the text in the window is light and hard to read. Also I think the whole shot needs to be roatated so that it''s straight. :)<br/></td>', 'You mean Eighty? :{Nice reflection but the text in the window is light and hard to read. Also I think the whole shot needs to be roatated so that it''s straight. :)', '2004-04-13 17:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(666101, 69319, 327, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwh. Cutie and he/she wants in. Good capture, great focus and nice light.</td>', 'Awwwwwh. Cutie and he/she wants in. Good capture, great focus and nice light.', '2004-04-13 17:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(666105, 69323, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I love the light in this capture. Maybe some clean up near the window sill to smooth that area out. Good entry hope you do well with this.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I love the light in this capture. Maybe some clean up near the window sill to smooth that area out. Good entry hope you do well with this.', '2004-04-13 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(666120, 68785, 6999, '<td valign="top">Really like this - and in general, I absolutely loathe the selective desturation trick. here it seems to have pint, emphasis, and a fittingness to the image beyond the very blunt ''look at this'' that it is ususally employed to shout. great feel, great depiction ofan emotion (the warmth of home, however temporary, perhaps). Just a wonderful photograph, really.</td>', 'Really like this - and in general, I absolutely loathe the selective desturation trick. here it seems to have pint, emphasis, and a fittingness to the image beyond the very blunt ''look at this'' that it is ususally employed to shout. great feel, great depiction ofan emotion (the warmth of home, however temporary, perhaps). Just a wonderful photograph, really.', '2004-04-13 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(666126, 68414, 6999, '<td valign="top">Out of Liverpool Street heading up towards Hackney, yes? I live in Bow, and think I probably have photos taken at almost exactly the same time - from very nearly the same angle, just a little further away - the placement of the gherkin and the Nat West Tower (as it shall ever be called), are almost exactly the same as the view from my window as I sit here typing ... really quite a creepy effect. I rmember that contrast of yellow/orange and blue light, and that weather front that swept across ... how very very wierd to see this here.<br/> <br/>Good shot too - especially love the fact that the only reference to a window is those reflections, and yet it''s so clearly taken through a wndow.</td>', 'Out of Liverpool Street heading up towards Hackney, yes? I live in Bow, and think I probably have photos taken at almost exactly the same time - from very nearly the same angle, just a little further away - the placement of the gherkin and the Nat West Tower (as it shall ever be called), are almost exactly the same as the view from my window as I sit here typing ... really quite a creepy effect. I rmember that contrast of yellow/orange and blue light, and that weather front that swept across ... how very very wierd to see this here. Good shot too - especially love the fact that the only reference to a window is those reflections, and yet it''s so clearly taken through a wndow.', '2004-04-13 18:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(666129, 69577, 16636, '<td valign="top">cracking view - I want to be there........</td>', 'cracking view - I want to be there........', '2004-04-13 18:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(666133, 69506, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough, the ''validation notice'' makes me wonder what might have been thought ''illegal'' about this shot. I would guess it''s a window frame taken to the shoot with you, but that really is a guess.<br/> <br/>It''s very well executed, though the scene beyond seems slightly washed out - lacking a touch of contrast, ofr a real punch.</td>', 'Strangely enough, the ''validation notice'' makes me wonder what might have been thought ''illegal'' about this shot. I would guess it''s a window frame taken to the shoot with you, but that really is a guess. It''s very well executed, though the scene beyond seems slightly washed out - lacking a touch of contrast, ofr a real punch.', '2004-04-13 18:31:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(666136, 69652, 6999, '<td valign="top">Oh my you''ll get slaughtered in the voting, I''m sure ... though I hope I''ve misjudged things. if it means anything, I hope it''s some consolation that I love this shot - love the communication of mood like this, the greyness, the focus on the small, the near as against the far, that comes with a rainy-grey-day kind of mood. Lovely, especially the light on the bottom edge of the window frame.</td>', 'Oh my you''ll get slaughtered in the voting, I''m sure ... though I hope I''ve misjudged things. if it means anything, I hope it''s some consolation that I love this shot - love the communication of mood like this, the greyness, the focus on the small, the near as against the far, that comes with a rainy-grey-day kind of mood. Lovely, especially the light on the bottom edge of the window frame.', '2004-04-13 18:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(666137, 69132, 6999, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of something, though i can''t recall what. Brian Harris perhaps. Love the tones around the curves of the minaret, particularly, and of course the framing of the crescent.</td>', 'Reminiscent of something, though i can''t recall what. Brian Harris perhaps. Love the tones around the curves of the minaret, particularly, and of course the framing of the crescent.', '2004-04-13 18:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(666144, 69254, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wow. Crazy, mad, threatening, ominous, and wonderful. I really wish the lines of the whatever-it-is were straight, from a rigidly compositional point of view. entrancing stuff though. Just great.</td>', 'Wow. Crazy, mad, threatening, ominous, and wonderful. I really wish the lines of the whatever-it-is were straight, from a rigidly compositional point of view. entrancing stuff though. Just great.', '2004-04-13 18:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(666166, 69582, 16301, '<td valign="top">It would have looked better if you had only the window frame in the "frame". I think that the kitchen detracts a lot from the photo. The view from the window is very beautiful though, I like how you captured the color in the sky :)<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'It would have looked better if you had only the window frame in the "frame". I think that the kitchen detracts a lot from the photo. The view from the window is very beautiful though, I like how you captured the color in the sky :) Good luck...', '2004-04-13 19:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(666168, 69506, 18068, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, i really like the white, pink and orangy colours they play a big role in emphasizing your picture. ;).</td>', 'Very nice photo, i really like the white, pink and orangy colours they play a big role in emphasizing your picture. ;).', '2004-04-13 19:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(666217, 69642, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, colors.</td>', 'Nice exposure, colors.', '2004-04-13 19:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(666220, 69233, 19608, '<td valign="top">Graphically pleasing.</td>', 'Graphically pleasing.', '2004-04-13 19:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(666222, 69132, 16636, '<td valign="top">superb composition, I like everything about this photo, one of my favourites</td>', 'superb composition, I like everything about this photo, one of my favourites', '2004-04-13 19:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(666233, 69608, 19608, '<td valign="top">Oh, please get rid of the background.  Try a much shallower DOF.</td>', 'Oh, please get rid of the background.  Try a much shallower DOF.', '2004-04-13 20:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(666235, 69675, 19608, '<td valign="top">Reflection work well. The more you look the more you see.</td>', 'Reflection work well. The more you look the more you see.', '2004-04-13 20:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(666238, 69579, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2004-04-13 20:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(666295, 69671, 18080, '<td valign="top">not safe me thinks...</td>', 'not safe me thinks...', '2004-04-13 20:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(666297, 68873, 18080, '<td valign="top">really hope this is candid</td>', 'really hope this is candid', '2004-04-13 20:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(666403, 69323, 19538, '<td valign="top">I feel that the lack of the depth of field takes away from this photo. Having the water in focus would have added more interesting detail.</td>', 'I feel that the lack of the depth of field takes away from this photo. Having the water in focus would have added more interesting detail.', '2004-04-13 22:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(666426, 69562, 20109, '<td valign="top">Nice use of form and color. Pleasing.</td>', 'Nice use of form and color. Pleasing.', '2004-04-13 22:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(666428, 69132, 20109, '<td valign="top">Stunner.</td>', 'Stunner.', '2004-04-13 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(666471, 68375, 6349, '<td valign="top">The colors, texture, and mood created here work well together.  The image gives me a disturbing feeling of uncleanliness.  I''d try to get rid of the bluish? tint on parts of the hand and I might even crop off a bit of the top. and focus more on the hand itself.  Still a 10</td>', 'The colors, texture, and mood created here work well together.  The image gives me a disturbing feeling of uncleanliness.  I''d try to get rid of the bluish? tint on parts of the hand and I might even crop off a bit of the top. and focus more on the hand itself.  Still a 10', '2004-04-13 23:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(666474, 68414, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo in the challenge.  Excellent work.  10</td>', 'This is my favorite photo in the challenge.  Excellent work.  10', '2004-04-13 23:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(666477, 69624, 6349, '<td valign="top">Love your toning.  I''d love it if you could share your editing workflow to achieve the tone after the challenge is over.  10</td>', 'Love your toning.  I''d love it if you could share your editing workflow to achieve the tone after the challenge is over.  10', '2004-04-13 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(666481, 69656, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best shots in the challenge, one of the few in which the off center placement of the blurry windowframe actually works as it is balanced by the kids silhouette.  The vintage sepia look works well with the candid nature of the shot and the timelss horse.  10</td>', 'This is one of the best shots in the challenge, one of the few in which the off center placement of the blurry windowframe actually works as it is balanced by the kids silhouette.  The vintage sepia look works well with the candid nature of the shot and the timelss horse.  10', '2004-04-13 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(666489, 69629, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I like the blue light from the television set and the fact that the tv is actually seen reflected in the mirror.  Get rid of that bright spot on the door and give it a gentle run through neatimage.  9</td>', 'Great idea.  I like the blue light from the television set and the fact that the tv is actually seen reflected in the mirror.  Get rid of that bright spot on the door and give it a gentle run through neatimage.  9', '2004-04-13 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(666492, 69535, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of highkey and lowkey here and the silhouette with the hat is very effective.  I need to go out and buy a cool hat for the silhouette challenge I think!  10</td>', 'I like the contrast of highkey and lowkey here and the silhouette with the hat is very effective.  I need to go out and buy a cool hat for the silhouette challenge I think!  10', '2004-04-13 23:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(666497, 69390, 6349, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this image the more i like it.  The off-kilterness adds to the feeling of vertigo looking down as if falling into the past.  The lines of the window, wal, ledge, shadows, and horizon make interesting shapes.  I can tell a lot of thought was put into the composition. 9</td>', 'The more I look at this image the more i like it.  The off-kilterness adds to the feeling of vertigo looking down as if falling into the past.  The lines of the window, wal, ledge, shadows, and horizon make interesting shapes.  I can tell a lot of thought was put into the composition. 9', '2004-04-13 23:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(666501, 69134, 6349, '<td valign="top">The washed out sky and the straightline at the top really take away from this fantastic image.  If this is somewhere near where you live you absolutely must go out here when the lighting is perfect.  Perhaps a slightly wider crop would add more balance. 9</td>', 'The washed out sky and the straightline at the top really take away from this fantastic image.  If this is somewhere near where you live you absolutely must go out here when the lighting is perfect.  Perhaps a slightly wider crop would add more balance. 9', '2004-04-13 23:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(666503, 69556, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Perfect.  Nothing to say really.  Might get scored low since the view is not out the window or reflected in the window, hence it is not a window view, but I still give it a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Perfect.  Nothing to say really.  Might get scored low since the view is not out the window or reflected in the window, hence it is not a window view, but I still give it a 10.', '2004-04-13 23:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(666511, 69518, 6349, '<td valign="top">What a face.  I love to see people submit GOOD pet shots.  I hate how people bitch (no pun intended) and moan about it all the time.  Dogs can do no wrong by me, only photographers that think any photo of their dog is good.  You get a 10 from me because this really is good and quality photography like this should never be frowned upon no matter how cliche the subject.</td>', 'What a face.  I love to see people submit GOOD pet shots.  I hate how people bitch (no pun intended) and moan about it all the time.  Dogs can do no wrong by me, only photographers that think any photo of their dog is good.  You get a 10 from me because this really is good and quality photography like this should never be frowned upon no matter how cliche the subject.', '2004-04-13 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(666518, 69132, 6349, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly tilted.  I would have gotten rid of the light on the sides all together.  The composition here is fantastic.  You have a great eye.  I don''t care for the sepia in this image, it does nothing for me.  8</td>', 'Seems slightly tilted.  I would have gotten rid of the light on the sides all together.  The composition here is fantastic.  You have a great eye.  I don''t care for the sepia in this image, it does nothing for me.  8', '2004-04-13 23:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(666519, 68505, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shots for the challenge.  Great work.  10</td>', 'One of my favorite shots for the challenge.  Great work.  10', '2004-04-13 23:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(666526, 69562, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding.  I love it.  I can''t say why exactly.  The circle, the orange and blue building, the backwards grimy notary writing.  Everything gives me this feeling that I need to escape all the paperwork and live free!  Seriously though, this is one of my favorites and I hope it does well.  10</td>', 'This is outstanding.  I love it.  I can''t say why exactly.  The circle, the orange and blue building, the backwards grimy notary writing.  Everything gives me this feeling that I need to escape all the paperwork and live free!  Seriously though, this is one of my favorites and I hope it does well.  10', '2004-04-13 23:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(666529, 68688, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of the best.  The fact that the bottom left pane doesn''t have textured glass is bothersome.  Everything else is beautiful.  Composition, lines, colors, textures.  10</td>', 'One of the best.  The fact that the bottom left pane doesn''t have textured glass is bothersome.  Everything else is beautiful.  Composition, lines, colors, textures.  10', '2004-04-13 23:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(666535, 69054, 6349, '<td valign="top">I have a guess as to whose this is....I love the toning on this, which is funny cause you''d think a turquoise/greenish/purpley cat would be something rather well, uh, gross.  But this really gives a sense of mystery to the car, behind the eyes it looks wise.  Artistic pet photographers unite! 10</td>', 'I have a guess as to whose this is....I love the toning on this, which is funny cause you''d think a turquoise/greenish/purpley cat would be something rather well, uh, gross.  But this really gives a sense of mystery to the car, behind the eyes it looks wise.  Artistic pet photographers unite! 10', '2004-04-13 23:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(666540, 69323, 6349, '<td valign="top">Have to give this a 10.  There is really no other choice in the matter as far as I can see.  10</td>', 'Have to give this a 10.  There is really no other choice in the matter as far as I can see.  10', '2004-04-13 23:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(666542, 69465, 6349, '<td valign="top">How you managed to take a snapshot out your car window and get an 8 from me is baffling, but you did it!  Congrats on a remarkable well balanced and pleasing image.</td>', 'How you managed to take a snapshot out your car window and get an 8 from me is baffling, but you did it!  Congrats on a remarkable well balanced and pleasing image.', '2004-04-13 23:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(666543, 69138, 6349, '<td valign="top">The title seems to contradict the photo, which I really like.  9</td>', 'The title seems to contradict the photo, which I really like.  9', '2004-04-13 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(666544, 69439, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the juxtaposition of lightening with the lighted power lines. Very cool. But I wish you could have eliminated the reflection of the indoor office space you''re in.</td>', 'I really like the juxtaposition of lightening with the lighted power lines. Very cool. But I wish you could have eliminated the reflection of the indoor office space you''re in.', '2004-04-13 23:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(666547, 68871, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of the best of the challenge.  Great framing and nice choice for black and white.  I get the feeling of a brisk walk when spring has just arrived or maybe you hope it has.  :) 10</td>', 'One of the best of the challenge.  Great framing and nice choice for black and white.  I get the feeling of a brisk walk when spring has just arrived or maybe you hope it has.  :) 10', '2004-04-13 23:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(666549, 69629, 5822, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo. I really like the blue and red tones and the composition is impecable.  Way to go!</td>', 'Terrific photo. I really like the blue and red tones and the composition is impecable.  Way to go!', '2004-04-13 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(666555, 69544, 6349, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the title means but that is my opinion when I look at this photo.  I keep coming back to it.  I find it extraordinarily dynamic and mundane at the same time, both hopeful and annihilistic  Thank you for sharing this rare gem.  10</td>', 'Not sure what the title means but that is my opinion when I look at this photo.  I keep coming back to it.  I find it extraordinarily dynamic and mundane at the same time, both hopeful and annihilistic  Thank you for sharing this rare gem.  10', '2004-04-13 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(666560, 69660, 5822, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty sharp line of light and dark that divides the photo in half. Had you considered using a graduated ND filter?</td>', 'That''s a pretty sharp line of light and dark that divides the photo in half. Had you considered using a graduated ND filter?', '2004-04-13 23:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(666561, 69618, 6349, '<td valign="top">Sonja?  Very nice idea.  I could be wrong but it looks like some burning was doen to the window to draw the eye to the window art.  It doesn''t look natural for a window to be so grey.  The highlight under the arm is a bit harsh as well.  The lighting on the face, however, is terrific, couldn''t be better, and the expression is of fierce concentration.  8</td>', 'Sonja?  Very nice idea.  I could be wrong but it looks like some burning was doen to the window to draw the eye to the window art.  It doesn''t look natural for a window to be so grey.  The highlight under the arm is a bit harsh as well.  The lighting on the face, however, is terrific, couldn''t be better, and the expression is of fierce concentration.  8', '2004-04-13 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(666565, 69588, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is a 10.  Has the feel of film.  Lovely work.</td>', 'This is a 10.  Has the feel of film.  Lovely work.', '2004-04-13 23:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(666567, 68785, 10818, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. But I think I would have gone all black and white or all color....wonderful shot though.....7</td>', 'I really like this shot. But I think I would have gone all black and white or all color....wonderful shot though.....7', '2004-04-13 23:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(666568, 69675, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love how you''ve included in the image both inside and ouside elements. Also, color is very good, especially the gold.  Well done on this classic image.</td>', 'Love how you''ve included in the image both inside and ouside elements. Also, color is very good, especially the gold.  Well done on this classic image.', '2004-04-13 23:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(666570, 69042, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am not normally a fan of cat shots, but I do love this one.  8</td>', 'I am not normally a fan of cat shots, but I do love this one.  8', '2004-04-13 23:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(666578, 69145, 10818, '<td valign="top">So cute, and funny.  Its a great shot.  I may have cropped a bit off the bottom, but I love it...nice one.  9</td>', 'So cute, and funny.  Its a great shot.  I may have cropped a bit off the bottom, but I love it...nice one.  9', '2004-04-14 00:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(666582, 69318, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is well done but subject matter is not compelling and has ugly shadows. Color is good, though.</td>', 'Composition is well done but subject matter is not compelling and has ugly shadows. Color is good, though.', '2004-04-14 00:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(666587, 69669, 10818, '<td valign="top">HAH- I love the title !  Super shot of the dog-did you teach him rule of thirds?  :)<br/>Great entry, good luck !</td>', 'HAH- I love the title !  Super shot of the dog-did you teach him rule of thirds?  :)Great entry, good luck !', '2004-04-14 00:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(666591, 69652, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the muted colors of this brooding and moody image but I find the inclusion of a very small part of the window and scene below wanting and frustrating and your alignment of the window frame with the borders of the image to be haphazard. Could have been a really great shot.</td>', 'I love the muted colors of this brooding and moody image but I find the inclusion of a very small part of the window and scene below wanting and frustrating and your alignment of the window frame with the borders of the image to be haphazard. Could have been a really great shot.', '2004-04-14 00:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(666598, 69540, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and well done.  I love the yellow and black/brown tones and the alignment of the doorway/archway with the image frame.  Borders are very good as well.</td>', 'Very beautiful and well done.  I love the yellow and black/brown tones and the alignment of the doorway/archway with the image frame.  Borders are very good as well.', '2004-04-14 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(666606, 69506, 10818, '<td valign="top">Its beautiful.  Just wonderful colors, the pier in the background is awesome, as are the rocks in the foreground.  Fantastic shot.  10</td>', 'Its beautiful.  Just wonderful colors, the pier in the background is awesome, as are the rocks in the foreground.  Fantastic shot.  10', '2004-04-14 00:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(666608, 69556, 5822, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful composition, lighting and tones, but I"m not sure it meets the challenge theme as there isn''t much of a view.  Still, a terrific image.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful composition, lighting and tones, but I"m not sure it meets the challenge theme as there isn''t much of a view.  Still, a terrific image.', '2004-04-14 00:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(666614, 68551, 5822, '<td valign="top">.</td>', '.', '2004-04-14 00:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(666618, 69506, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the soft pastel colors and the silhouetted rocks in the foreground.  This image has a wonderful surrealistic feeling and the bird in the lower left corner is perfect. Well done.</td>', 'I love the soft pastel colors and the silhouetted rocks in the foreground.  This image has a wonderful surrealistic feeling and the bird in the lower left corner is perfect. Well done.', '2004-04-14 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(666629, 69042, 5822, '<td valign="top">High noise levels blemish this equisite cat portrait. Also, leveling of the window frame within the borders of the image is a bit haphazard, and I would have preferred to see the top and left sides of the window frame too. Still, I don''t think I''ve ever loved a cat picture as much as this. Excellent capture!</td>', 'High noise levels blemish this equisite cat portrait. Also, leveling of the window frame within the borders of the image is a bit haphazard, and I would have preferred to see the top and left sides of the window frame too. Still, I don''t think I''ve ever loved a cat picture as much as this. Excellent capture!', '2004-04-14 00:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(666633, 69630, 5822, '<td valign="top">Colors are equisite and composition is quite good although your horizon line is very slanted. Subject matter is compelling. Contrast is a bit too high and even though there is a small bit of window showing in the bottom right, I really don''t feel it''s enough to meet the challenge theme.</td>', 'Colors are equisite and composition is quite good although your horizon line is very slanted. Subject matter is compelling. Contrast is a bit too high and even though there is a small bit of window showing in the bottom right, I really don''t feel it''s enough to meet the challenge theme.', '2004-04-14 00:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(666716, 69132, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting and compelling photograph.  I love the tones of the view outdoors, but it''s a bit dark and hard to tell what the structure is exactly. The silhouetted frame of the door/window is also very interesting.  I think this is a special photograph.</td>', 'This is a very interesting and compelling photograph.  I love the tones of the view outdoors, but it''s a bit dark and hard to tell what the structure is exactly. The silhouetted frame of the door/window is also very interesting.  I think this is a special photograph.', '2004-04-14 01:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(666808, 69671, 15511, '<td valign="top">I''m sure some will comment (or congratulate you) on making it home to submit this image. At least you made it on time :&gt;)&gt;<br/>I say to them, "Speed does NOT kill, stopping abruptly is what kills."<br/>Must be California, it''s green in winter, and the sun shines 24 hours a day...</td>', 'I''m sure some will comment (or congratulate you) on making it home to submit this image. At least you made it on time :>)>I say to them, "Speed does NOT kill, stopping abruptly is what kills."Must be California, it''s green in winter, and the sun shines 24 hours a day...', '2004-04-14 02:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(667075, 69233, 18505, '<td valign="top">Striking picture!! Love the angles of the buildings and the windows.  Hope you do very well in the challenge.</td>', 'Striking picture!! Love the angles of the buildings and the windows.  Hope you do very well in the challenge.', '2004-04-14 06:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(667078, 69384, 18505, '<td valign="top">I don''t like flying, but I do like your picture!!  Excellent interpretation of challenge.  (Now where''s my dramamine)</td>', 'I don''t like flying, but I do like your picture!!  Excellent interpretation of challenge.  (Now where''s my dramamine)', '2004-04-14 06:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(667197, 69543, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you were trying to achieve here. The brief asked for an interesting window view, and  my eye is not drawn to anything of interest. The reflections contain a lot of burnt out highlights. The motion blur is small enough to look accidental. My eye demands a point of focus here!</td>', 'Not sure what you were trying to achieve here. The brief asked for an interesting window view, and  my eye is not drawn to anything of interest. The reflections contain a lot of burnt out highlights. The motion blur is small enough to look accidental. My eye demands a point of focus here!', '2004-04-14 07:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(667203, 69677, 4008, '<td valign="top">Assuming the noise and poor sharpness is a limitation of your camera I won''t judge the picture on that. You could have cropped the bottom part away, up to the horizontal bar, the leave area doesn''t add anything. The cat could have done with some more space around it, it is very close to the edge. And for me it is an uninteresting picture, although meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Assuming the noise and poor sharpness is a limitation of your camera I won''t judge the picture on that. You could have cropped the bottom part away, up to the horizontal bar, the leave area doesn''t add anything. The cat could have done with some more space around it, it is very close to the edge. And for me it is an uninteresting picture, although meeting the challenge.', '2004-04-14 07:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(667205, 69054, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very strange color cast.</td>', 'Very strange color cast.', '2004-04-14 07:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(667206, 69629, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice use of colour to set the atmosphere. Terrible noise levels (blue channels are usually the noisiest), did you try NeatImage? Another alternative would have been to desaturate just the red or green channel, and then turn the whole photo blue. You''d have lost the reds though. The background is compositionally too cluttered otherwise this would have been a really high-impact shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice use of colour to set the atmosphere. Terrible noise levels (blue channels are usually the noisiest), did you try NeatImage? Another alternative would have been to desaturate just the red or green channel, and then turn the whole photo blue. You''d have lost the reds though. The background is compositionally too cluttered otherwise this would have been a really high-impact shot.', '2004-04-14 07:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(667210, 69675, 8522, '<td valign="top">This view doesn''t do much for me and seems compositionally badly thought out. My eye has no clear point of focus. The foreground car has been chopped in two by a pillar. The reflections are very offputting.</td>', 'This view doesn''t do much for me and seems compositionally badly thought out. My eye has no clear point of focus. The foreground car has been chopped in two by a pillar. The reflections are very offputting.', '2004-04-14 07:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(667214, 69678, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice range of tones. I wish the figure''s silhouette was clearer. I like the subtle colours, maybe black and white would have been even more effective? I like the way the picture draws me in and makes me ask what is happening.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice range of tones. I wish the figure''s silhouette was clearer. I like the subtle colours, maybe black and white would have been even more effective? I like the way the picture draws me in and makes me ask what is happening.', '2004-04-14 07:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(667217, 69525, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what you wanted to achieve here, the view seems compositionally very messy and uninteresting. It''s almost an interesting study of light and shadow, outside and inside but the composition doesn''t pull this off. There are too many burnt out highlights. A clear point of focus is what the photo really needs.</td>', 'Not quite sure what you wanted to achieve here, the view seems compositionally very messy and uninteresting. It''s almost an interesting study of light and shadow, outside and inside but the composition doesn''t pull this off. There are too many burnt out highlights. A clear point of focus is what the photo really needs.', '2004-04-14 07:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(667222, 69132, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well composed. I wish the conical thing below the crescent was more centred though. Great exposure, especially the trees. This is what makes the shot so striking for me. I would have liked more sharpness, maybe with soft focus added after having sharpened.</td>', 'Nice shot, well composed. I wish the conical thing below the crescent was more centred though. Great exposure, especially the trees. This is what makes the shot so striking for me. I would have liked more sharpness, maybe with soft focus added after having sharpened.', '2004-04-14 08:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(667225, 69161, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the fireman has been caught in just the wrong position. I''d have liked to be able to focus on his face/mask or the sledgehammer. These are both currently obscured. Catching him at the point where the glass was breaking would really transform the picture. I''m not sure you exposed for the fireman, and I think this would also have helped.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the fireman has been caught in just the wrong position. I''d have liked to be able to focus on his face/mask or the sledgehammer. These are both currently obscured. Catching him at the point where the glass was breaking would really transform the picture. I''m not sure you exposed for the fireman, and I think this would also have helped.', '2004-04-14 08:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(667229, 69639, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, some interesting composition and textures. Overall the picture is not sharp enough, the textured glass is very blurry and the large amounts of glare on the right side of the frame is very offputting. The bevelled part of the shot works very well.</td>', 'Interesting idea, some interesting composition and textures. Overall the picture is not sharp enough, the textured glass is very blurry and the large amounts of glare on the right side of the frame is very offputting. The bevelled part of the shot works very well.', '2004-04-14 08:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(667286, 69028, 14603, '<td valign="top">A slightly different angle, framing the mountain and losing the flagpole and this would be a winner.</td>', 'A slightly different angle, framing the mountain and losing the flagpole and this would be a winner.', '2004-04-14 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(667290, 69624, 16636, '<td valign="top">great atmospheric image - one of my favourites</td>', 'great atmospheric image - one of my favourites', '2004-04-14 08:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(667294, 69472, 14603, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far..the colour variations on the roof, the light hitting the crossbeams and overall composition make this a winner for me....10</td>', 'My favourite so far..the colour variations on the roof, the light hitting the crossbeams and overall composition make this a winner for me....10', '2004-04-14 08:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(667319, 68785, 14603, '<td valign="top">great idea, very well executed..I like the partial desat technique, although it doesn`t always score too well at DPC.<br/>Good luck...9</td>', 'great idea, very well executed..I like the partial desat technique, although it doesn`t always score too well at DPC.Good luck...9', '2004-04-14 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(667327, 69160, 14603, '<td valign="top">Really nice silhouette effect with the lighting...unfortunately, there is little evidence of the window frame which may lower your score with some voters..I am guessing this was taken from a vehicle?...nice image...8</td>', 'Really nice silhouette effect with the lighting...unfortunately, there is little evidence of the window frame which may lower your score with some voters..I am guessing this was taken from a vehicle?...nice image...8', '2004-04-14 09:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(667350, 69528, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and good use of colour and DOF</td>', 'Nicely composed and good use of colour and DOF', '2004-04-14 09:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(667374, 68375, 19473, '<td valign="top">This I like.  An interesting shot well composed.  Well done!</td>', 'This I like.  An interesting shot well composed.  Well done!', '2004-04-14 09:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(667609, 69499, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not a very inspiring view, and the extreme range of tones in the shot means that the view out of the window is washed out and lacking in detail. There is no clear point of focus for the eye to settle on, and I think this is my main problem with this shot.</td>', 'Not a very inspiring view, and the extreme range of tones in the shot means that the view out of the window is washed out and lacking in detail. There is no clear point of focus for the eye to settle on, and I think this is my main problem with this shot.', '2004-04-14 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(667614, 69319, 8522, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous. As this is an advanced challenge, I would have used the perspective tool in Photoshop to make the window frame completely parallel to the edge of the photo. Lovely backlighting on the fur and the drops add compositional interest and texture. It''s a shame that the windowframe isn''t more squre so that we can see the top of it in the photo.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous. As this is an advanced challenge, I would have used the perspective tool in Photoshop to make the window frame completely parallel to the edge of the photo. Lovely backlighting on the fur and the drops add compositional interest and texture. It''s a shame that the windowframe isn''t more squre so that we can see the top of it in the photo.', '2004-04-14 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(667619, 69506, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice! I can''t see why this photo shouldn''t do very well in this challenge. Great colours, nice soft silhouettes. I like the reflection of the sun. You really should have tidied up  that rogue top pixel in your crop which looks accidental to me. As this is an advanced challenge, I''d have used the distort/perspective command in Photoshop to make the windowframe completely square, and then perhaps cropped tighter.</td>', 'Wow, very nice! I can''t see why this photo shouldn''t do very well in this challenge. Great colours, nice soft silhouettes. I like the reflection of the sun. You really should have tidied up  that rogue top pixel in your crop which looks accidental to me. As this is an advanced challenge, I''d have used the distort/perspective command in Photoshop to make the windowframe completely square, and then perhaps cropped tighter.', '2004-04-14 11:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(667625, 69234, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but looks a little too much like a snapshot. Because the boy is the only element in shap focus, it is confusing as to what the main point of focus here is. As you are presumably trying to get the viewer''s eye to settle on the chimp''s(?) hand, I would have taken the shot from behind the boy to make it clearer what we are supposed to look at.</td>', 'Nice shot, but looks a little too much like a snapshot. Because the boy is the only element in shap focus, it is confusing as to what the main point of focus here is. As you are presumably trying to get the viewer''s eye to settle on the chimp''s(?) hand, I would have taken the shot from behind the boy to make it clearer what we are supposed to look at.', '2004-04-14 11:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(667646, 69535, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  A definite ribbon contender.  I love the foreground you''ve included.</td>', 'Lovely.  A definite ribbon contender.  I love the foreground you''ve included.', '2004-04-14 12:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(667674, 69512, 18765, '<td valign="top">is that a ghost ship??</td>', 'is that a ghost ship??', '2004-04-14 12:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(667683, 69467, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful sky and a wonderful graphic created by the window.  I like how the window panes echo a rising sun and sunbeams juxtaposed to the real sunbeams behind.  However, it BEGS to be perfectly centered or else have the "rays" of the frame coming out from the corner.  As it is, the placement of the panes seems haphazard and keeps this from really being as spectacular as it could be.</td>', 'This is a beautiful sky and a wonderful graphic created by the window.  I like how the window panes echo a rising sun and sunbeams juxtaposed to the real sunbeams behind.  However, it BEGS to be perfectly centered or else have the "rays" of the frame coming out from the corner.  As it is, the placement of the panes seems haphazard and keeps this from really being as spectacular as it could be.', '2004-04-14 12:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(667845, 69639, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I wish the flower was more centered within the diamond.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I wish the flower was more centered within the diamond.', '2004-04-14 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(667870, 69160, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though your window is hard to see (it appears to be a black frame in the left side and top), this composition is absolutely lovely!  I love the scene with the dark, but detailed foreground juxtaposed against the overexposed background landscape.  Great capture, but the image on the whole suffers from image degradation, from what, I"m not sure.  Exposure is good, but focus is lacking and it''s hard to see the person leaning against the tree in the midground.  Was this image greatly enlarged with in camera zoom or in software editing? Despite it''s shortcomings, high score given.</td>', 'Though your window is hard to see (it appears to be a black frame in the left side and top), this composition is absolutely lovely!  I love the scene with the dark, but detailed foreground juxtaposed against the overexposed background landscape.  Great capture, but the image on the whole suffers from image degradation, from what, I"m not sure.  Exposure is good, but focus is lacking and it''s hard to see the person leaning against the tree in the midground.  Was this image greatly enlarged with in camera zoom or in software editing? Despite it''s shortcomings, high score given.', '2004-04-14 13:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
