(668339, 68414, 19920, '<td valign="top">Normally this would have been a boring grayish cityscape. But the right time, right place mixed with a photographer with an eye, creates an image with mood and power. Nice composition on the fly. Like the angles and the sense of force created by the onset of the storm. I do however wish the colors were more vivid and the edges sharper. But understandable shooting through a tented window (I would guess) on the fly.</td>', 'Normally this would have been a boring grayish cityscape. But the right time, right place mixed with a photographer with an eye, creates an image with mood and power. Nice composition on the fly. Like the angles and the sense of force created by the onset of the storm. I do however wish the colors were more vivid and the edges sharper. But understandable shooting through a tented window (I would guess) on the fly.', '2004-04-14 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(668588, 69554, 11793, '<td valign="top">something looks weird about the bricks<br/> <br/>good one though</td>', 'something looks weird about the bricks good one though', '2004-04-14 19:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(668608, 68820, 11793, '<td valign="top">there doesnt seem to be much of a subject to this photo.<br/>nothing draws my eye.</td>', 'there doesnt seem to be much of a subject to this photo.nothing draws my eye.', '2004-04-14 19:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(668640, 69624, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done, good luck.<br/>gets you think.<br/></td>', 'well done, good luck.gets you think.', '2004-04-14 19:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(668645, 69556, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice black and white - a couple of the flowers seem to have a bit of a haze over them, maybe its part of the flower, but a  bit distracting.<br/> <br/>good luck</td>', 'nice black and white - a couple of the flowers seem to have a bit of a haze over them, maybe its part of the flower, but a  bit distracting. good luck', '2004-04-14 19:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(668692, 69577, 5822, '<td valign="top">A picturesque background that lacks contrast. Also, I wish the frame of the window extended to the bottom and more of the top of the image.  Cabling in the upper left hand corner is distracting.</td>', 'A picturesque background that lacks contrast. Also, I wish the frame of the window extended to the bottom and more of the top of the image.  Cabling in the upper left hand corner is distracting.', '2004-04-14 19:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(668706, 69465, 5822, '<td valign="top">Exposure and color is very good but the image, on the whole, is too busy for my tastes.  Also, the sky and railroad sign in the background appear to be distorted and too bad you included what appears to be the visor in the top left hand corner, which I find a bit distracting.</td>', 'Exposure and color is very good but the image, on the whole, is too busy for my tastes.  Also, the sky and railroad sign in the background appear to be distorted and too bad you included what appears to be the visor in the top left hand corner, which I find a bit distracting.', '2004-04-14 19:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(668717, 69674, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, but I think some contrasting color in the blinds would have added some interest.</td>', 'Nice abstract, but I think some contrasting color in the blinds would have added some interest.', '2004-04-14 19:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(668728, 69467, 6999, '<td valign="top">I guess other things perhaps ruin the composition, but I''d love to see that sun-burst placed in the middle of that window frame. Good exposure, good hyper-focal distance. The slight sharpening artefacts around the frame are actually quite effective in adding emphasis to the silhouette.</td>', 'I guess other things perhaps ruin the composition, but I''d love to see that sun-burst placed in the middle of that window frame. Good exposure, good hyper-focal distance. The slight sharpening artefacts around the frame are actually quite effective in adding emphasis to the silhouette.', '2004-04-14 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(668733, 69255, 6999, '<td valign="top">great portrait - love the light on the cheek, jaw and eye. obviously the shot is outside the challenge stipulation (you''d have a hard time convincing me that the subject of this shot is the view from a window), but I''d guess anough people will have bashed you for that already. My mind questions the cropping - but my eye finds the compositional balance very effective.</td>', 'great portrait - love the light on the cheek, jaw and eye. obviously the shot is outside the challenge stipulation (you''d have a hard time convincing me that the subject of this shot is the view from a window), but I''d guess anough people will have bashed you for that already. My mind questions the cropping - but my eye finds the compositional balance very effective.', '2004-04-14 19:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(668736, 69472, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lovely work, especially pleasing in its balance of colours and tones - complementary blue and orange are almost always effective. The definition in the steelwork creeping out from the silhouette is tremendous. I sense, beyond anything I could explain exactly, something missing though here - really couldn''t say what.</td>', 'Lovely work, especially pleasing in its balance of colours and tones - complementary blue and orange are almost always effective. The definition in the steelwork creeping out from the silhouette is tremendous. I sense, beyond anything I could explain exactly, something missing though here - really couldn''t say what.', '2004-04-14 19:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(668767, 69134, 19376, '<td valign="top">really nice shot</td>', 'really nice shot', '2004-04-14 20:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(668771, 68551, 19376, '<td valign="top">nice shot---hard to tell its a window--but pretty picture!! good job!!</td>', 'nice shot---hard to tell its a window--but pretty picture!! good job!!', '2004-04-14 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(668829, 69160, 19920, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the nicer photos. The color is beautiful. The mood caused from the light and the softness of the pastels in the background is very,very nice.  Compostionaly, I think the window frame really hurts this photo. Mainly the top, just having the left side doesn''t bother me-only my opinion. But I understand the challenge. Very good photo.</td>', 'I think this is one of the nicer photos. The color is beautiful. The mood caused from the light and the softness of the pastels in the background is very,very nice.  Compostionaly, I think the window frame really hurts this photo. Mainly the top, just having the left side doesn''t bother me-only my opinion. But I understand the challenge. Very good photo.', '2004-04-14 20:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(668853, 69390, 10111, '<td valign="top">the way this is framed on the left side seams off a bit.  other than that, very nice.</td>', 'the way this is framed on the left side seams off a bit.  other than that, very nice.', '2004-04-14 21:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(668863, 69407, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the outside background. The colors and glass pane distortions effect on the house is really great, but I find that your inclusion of the silhouetted window frame detracts and adds little to the enjoyment of this otherwise pleasureable image.  Maybe increasing cam distance to the window and showing more detail in the frame would have had a better effect for me.</td>', 'I love the outside background. The colors and glass pane distortions effect on the house is really great, but I find that your inclusion of the silhouetted window frame detracts and adds little to the enjoyment of this otherwise pleasureable image.  Maybe increasing cam distance to the window and showing more detail in the frame would have had a better effect for me.', '2004-04-14 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(668868, 69312, 5822, '<td valign="top">Spectacular scenery but I find the window frame lacking in appeal.</td>', 'Spectacular scenery but I find the window frame lacking in appeal.', '2004-04-14 21:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(668877, 68873, 5822, '<td valign="top">Neat fisheye effect! I like the subject matter, but wish the kissing couple were a bit closer to the peep hole.</td>', 'Neat fisheye effect! I like the subject matter, but wish the kissing couple were a bit closer to the peep hole.', '2004-04-14 21:20:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(668881, 69518, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and capture of the dogs character.  Being that I don''t see any rain drops on the window glass I think you should have used another title.</td>', 'Wonderful tones and capture of the dogs character.  Being that I don''t see any rain drops on the window glass I think you should have used another title.', '2004-04-14 21:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(669030, 68688, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice idea ... like the abstactness of it   (I don''t know if that is a word  :)  )</td>', 'nice idea ... like the abstactness of it   (I don''t know if that is a word  :)  )', '2004-04-14 23:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(669039, 69439, 10151, '<td valign="top">simply amazing...I''m partial to lighting photos.  U did very well with the colors, very vivid...oddly bright. Aside form the wires and pole, a great comp. 8</td>', 'simply amazing...I''m partial to lighting photos.  U did very well with the colors, very vivid...oddly bright. Aside form the wires and pole, a great comp. 8', '2004-04-14 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(669045, 69467, 10151, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this photo, light is great...sumbeams coming down is wonderful. 7</td>', 'I love the composition of this photo, light is great...sumbeams coming down is wonderful. 7', '2004-04-14 23:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(669051, 69671, 10151, '<td valign="top">The most amaing thing about this photo is that you where able to handle a camera going this fast.  I think some motion blur would help a bit (i do see some at the very edges, but more would be cool).</td>', 'The most amaing thing about this photo is that you where able to handle a camera going this fast.  I think some motion blur would help a bit (i do see some at the very edges, but more would be cool).', '2004-04-14 23:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(669064, 69510, 10151, '<td valign="top">I like this perspective! Perhaps because I grew up in the country and this kindles some memories...great job :)</td>', 'I like this perspective! Perhaps because I grew up in the country and this kindles some memories...great job :)', '2004-04-14 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(669067, 69540, 10151, '<td valign="top">i''m not a fan of such symetrical setups, but I really like the profile in the glass and the lighting turned out great.  Wonderful job!</td>', 'i''m not a fan of such symetrical setups, but I really like the profile in the glass and the lighting turned out great.  Wonderful job!', '2004-04-14 23:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(669068, 69652, 17937, '<td valign="top">You must live near me.  Thats all it seems to do around here anymore.  I hate rain..!</td>', 'You must live near me.  Thats all it seems to do around here anymore.  I hate rain..!', '2004-04-14 23:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(669071, 69506, 17937, '<td valign="top">Um, how the he11 did you do this?</td>', 'Um, how the he11 did you do this?', '2004-04-14 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(669073, 69395, 17937, '<td valign="top">I like how the angles seem to work there way down and in to the window.  Very nice...</td>', 'I like how the angles seem to work there way down and in to the window.  Very nice...', '2004-04-14 23:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(669192, 68551, 12160, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the view, nice shot but the black on the top left corner should have been removed and the horizon straightened.  6</td>', 'Love the colours and the view, nice shot but the black on the top left corner should have been removed and the horizon straightened.  6', '2004-04-15 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(669196, 69556, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice contrast/composition. love your shutters too!</td>', 'nice contrast/composition. love your shutters too!', '2004-04-15 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(669198, 69042, 12160, '<td valign="top">very cute, love the composition, the warm tint works for me. 7</td>', 'very cute, love the composition, the warm tint works for me. 7', '2004-04-15 00:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(669203, 68375, 12160, '<td valign="top">Blood? There must be a story here that I''m not getting. I like the sepia tone. I think you just wanted to draw attention to the hand and so you made it bloody. Works well. 7</td>', 'Blood? There must be a story here that I''m not getting. I like the sepia tone. I think you just wanted to draw attention to the hand and so you made it bloody. Works well. 7', '2004-04-15 01:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(669252, 69256, 12160, '<td valign="top">love the colours and the bevelled art. beautiful image. 7</td>', 'love the colours and the bevelled art. beautiful image. 7', '2004-04-15 01:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(669264, 69629, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice image, well-thought, well-composed. the blue tint works. too bad it suffers from colour noise esp at the bottom left. 7</td>', 'nice image, well-thought, well-composed. the blue tint works. too bad it suffers from colour noise esp at the bottom left. 7', '2004-04-15 01:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(669280, 69467, 12160, '<td valign="top">another beautiful sunset through a window. very nice image, just wished the highlight was more covered by the black edge. 9</td>', 'another beautiful sunset through a window. very nice image, just wished the highlight was more covered by the black edge. 9', '2004-04-15 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(669291, 69579, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice shot... good contrast. the reflections off the glass are distracting and hurt  the photo. A polarizing filter will reduce the glare. 5</td>', 'nice shot... good contrast. the reflections off the glass are distracting and hurt  the photo. A polarizing filter will reduce the glare. 5', '2004-04-15 02:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(669296, 69542, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice to see another familiar Toronto building... good shot! you handled the exposure quite well. 8</td>', 'Nice to see another familiar Toronto building... good shot! you handled the exposure quite well. 8', '2004-04-15 02:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(669297, 69535, 12160, '<td valign="top">i like this a lot, very moody. like the colour and the high contrast. 8</td>', 'i like this a lot, very moody. like the colour and the high contrast. 8', '2004-04-15 02:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(669310, 69656, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great focus, it really helps tell the story. Beautiful tone too.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Great focus, it really helps tell the story. Beautiful tone too. Good luck...', '2004-04-15 02:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(669312, 69548, 6477, '<td valign="top">Interesting work, I like it... very original... the black care adds to this an intriguing detail, good luck</td>', 'Interesting work, I like it... very original... the black care adds to this an intriguing detail, good luck', '2004-04-15 02:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(669313, 69506, 16301, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors and composition. The pier, the sun and its reflection, the rocks,  just beautiful. 10<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'I really love the colors and composition. The pier, the sun and its reflection, the rocks,  just beautiful. 10 Good luck...', '2004-04-15 02:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(669314, 69678, 6477, '<td valign="top">Good work, the idea is very original and well excecuted...</td>', 'Good work, the idea is very original and well excecuted...', '2004-04-15 02:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(669318, 69407, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, this is gorgeous, wonderful capture. Great contrast and lighting 10</td>', 'Outstanding, this is gorgeous, wonderful capture. Great contrast and lighting 10', '2004-04-15 02:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(669320, 69255, 6477, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image. The light is perfect as the concept... I think I would prefer to see a little more outside the window... great work</td>', 'Fantastic image. The light is perfect as the concept... I think I would prefer to see a little more outside the window... great work', '2004-04-15 02:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(669363, 69582, 4008, '<td valign="top">No need to include the kitchen with such a lovely view.</td>', 'No need to include the kitchen with such a lovely view.', '2004-04-15 03:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(669371, 69386, 20012, '<td valign="top">This would be a nice image without the window, imho. The faucet only serves to distract, and it''s not very pleasing.</td>', 'This would be a nice image without the window, imho. The faucet only serves to distract, and it''s not very pleasing.', '2004-04-15 04:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(669376, 69678, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, and a nice change from all the (understandably) glass windows.</td>', 'Excellent photo, and a nice change from all the (understandably) glass windows.', '2004-04-15 04:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(669379, 68873, 10170, '<td valign="top">Nice twist on the challenge theme.  Love it.</td>', 'Nice twist on the challenge theme.  Love it.', '2004-04-15 04:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(669391, 69582, 15407, '<td valign="top">Hot spots from the flash distract, perhaps a shot made closer to the window may have worked better. What a wonderful view you have... I ''d love to have a kitchen view like that!</td>', 'Hot spots from the flash distract, perhaps a shot made closer to the window may have worked better. What a wonderful view you have... I ''d love to have a kitchen view like that!', '2004-04-15 05:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(669394, 69669, 15407, '<td valign="top">A cute subject. I believe a little less USM may have produced a softer, more appealing (to me) photo.</td>', 'A cute subject. I believe a little less USM may have produced a softer, more appealing (to me) photo.', '2004-04-15 05:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(669397, 69159, 15407, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing . it makes it a good picture. Perhaps iIf you moved slightly to the right if it would have framed the man and the child in the 2nd frame from the right such that each of the frames would have had a centered ''subject'' ?</td>', 'I really like the framing . it makes it a good picture. Perhaps iIf you moved slightly to the right if it would have framed the man and the child in the 2nd frame from the right such that each of the frames would have had a centered ''subject'' ?', '2004-04-15 05:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(669398, 69548, 15407, '<td valign="top">You spotted an interesting number of elements and made the best of less than ideal lighting, yet something about the composure doesn''t quite work for me.  I think I wonerd if you tried to get a wider angle in a shot like this you may have had a little more freedom in croping for a neater composure?</td>', 'You spotted an interesting number of elements and made the best of less than ideal lighting, yet something about the composure doesn''t quite work for me.  I think I wonerd if you tried to get a wider angle in a shot like this you may have had a little more freedom in croping for a neater composure?', '2004-04-15 05:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(669400, 69630, 15407, '<td valign="top">The off kilter horizon distract too much in this picture. THere are a number of programs that allow for a quick and accurate correction.  I know I often have to correct my shots to true up the horizon. Otherwise this is a beautiful view and very nicely exposed... Wish I was there right now!</td>', 'The off kilter horizon distract too much in this picture. THere are a number of programs that allow for a quick and accurate correction.  I know I often have to correct my shots to true up the horizon. Otherwise this is a beautiful view and very nicely exposed... Wish I was there right now!', '2004-04-15 05:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(669403, 68551, 15407, '<td valign="top">Its a shame that airplanes don''t have a ''viewing/photo area from which to take high quality pictures from. It''s soo very difficult to get good shots through the coke bottle windows, and the views are sometimes spectactular. The colors and sharpness suffer quite a bit with those constraints and its hard to fix later.</td>', 'Its a shame that airplanes don''t have a ''viewing/photo area from which to take high quality pictures from. It''s soo very difficult to get good shots through the coke bottle windows, and the views are sometimes spectactular. The colors and sharpness suffer quite a bit with those constraints and its hard to fix later.', '2004-04-15 05:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(669405, 69256, 15407, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I would have preferred the frames around the glass to be sharper though. Would that have been possible using a tripodand the smallest aperature?</td>', 'Very nice. I would have preferred the frames around the glass to be sharper though. Would that have been possible using a tripodand the smallest aperature?', '2004-04-15 05:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(669408, 69658, 15407, '<td valign="top">Serine &amp; beautiful... the little kid in me wants to see how many times I could skip a flat rock on that pool of water.  I would have liked to have seen this shot with a little less sharpening.</td>', 'Serine & beautiful... the little kid in me wants to see how many times I could skip a flat rock on that pool of water.  I would have liked to have seen this shot with a little less sharpening.', '2004-04-15 05:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(669414, 69547, 15407, '<td valign="top">Great potential yet I would have preferred much less extrenious lighting, (the moving lights in the left lower framing, and the reflection on the right side of the windshield.</td>', 'Great potential yet I would have preferred much less extrenious lighting, (the moving lights in the left lower framing, and the reflection on the right side of the windshield.', '2004-04-15 05:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(669416, 69512, 15407, '<td valign="top">Something looks out of place here, hard for me to put my finger on it though</td>', 'Something looks out of place here, hard for me to put my finger on it though', '2004-04-15 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(669417, 68717, 15407, '<td valign="top">Thats very nice... Wish I had something like that for more poor old pepper plants but the meaniner I am to them the ''meaner'' the peppers get.... and that''s a good thing. The lighting is great, I even like the direct sunlight at the top of the picture ''accounting '' for the reflections on the 4 mil plastic. The plants look helathy &amp; happy too!</td>', 'Thats very nice... Wish I had something like that for more poor old pepper plants but the meaniner I am to them the ''meaner'' the peppers get.... and that''s a good thing. The lighting is great, I even like the direct sunlight at the top of the picture ''accounting '' for the reflections on the 4 mil plastic. The plants look helathy & happy too!', '2004-04-15 06:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(669422, 69386, 15407, '<td valign="top">What a fabulious subject and framing.  I''m guessing that you get to see ''Rocky'' often and preparing for a shot like this you might have moved the distracting furnature in the foreground out of the frame.</td>', 'What a fabulious subject and framing.  I''m guessing that you get to see ''Rocky'' often and preparing for a shot like this you might have moved the distracting furnature in the foreground out of the frame.', '2004-04-15 06:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(669423, 69578, 15407, '<td valign="top">I have to say that this looks more like a trip to WORK than what I have seen on scenic train rides.great wondow shot of an ugly view.</td>', 'I have to say that this looks more like a trip to WORK than what I have seen on scenic train rides.great wondow shot of an ugly view.', '2004-04-15 06:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(669426, 69042, 15407, '<td valign="top">No problem... let it out.</td>', 'No problem... let it out.', '2004-04-15 06:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(669433, 69678, 15407, '<td valign="top">There is something.something surreal about the figure in the shadow outside and the way the lighting is coming fom outside into the inside.  The window frame is full of character too. This is a trippy photo, I ike it ! One of my faves in this challenge.</td>', 'There is something.something surreal about the figure in the shadow outside and the way the lighting is coming fom outside into the inside.  The window frame is full of character too. This is a trippy photo, I ike it ! One of my faves in this challenge.', '2004-04-15 06:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(669439, 69134, 15407, '<td valign="top">You crated a very nice photo. Evocative of the labors of mankind for a special cause, though it has dwindeled away over time, there remains an accomplishment of passion to be appreciated.</td>', 'You crated a very nice photo. Evocative of the labors of mankind for a special cause, though it has dwindeled away over time, there remains an accomplishment of passion to be appreciated.', '2004-04-15 06:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(669444, 69498, 15407, '<td valign="top">The composure is seems awkward and the lighting seems unatural for an out the window shot. If its an in the window shot the lighting is again unatural</td>', 'The composure is seems awkward and the lighting seems unatural for an out the window shot. If its an in the window shot the lighting is again unatural', '2004-04-15 06:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(669445, 69510, 15407, '<td valign="top">Looks like a neat idea &amp; photo that turned into a lot of post processing work. I think you pulled it off OK.</td>', 'Looks like a neat idea & photo that turned into a lot of post processing work. I think you pulled it off OK.', '2004-04-15 06:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(669448, 69577, 15407, '<td valign="top">What a nice view &amp; photo !  Its a shame more people couldn''t have taken photos with views as nice as this. Extra points for color &amp; composure too.</td>', 'What a nice view & photo !  Its a shame more people couldn''t have taken photos with views as nice as this. Extra points for color & composure too.', '2004-04-15 06:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(669453, 68948, 15407, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice, but cold, capture,,, Perhaps thats the natural outside lighting or you made it so ... maybe even the moons reflection off the swimming pool? My sick mind wants to see a witch riding a broom across the face of the moon. So its time to give this a nice vote and call it quits for the night.</td>', 'Quite a nice, but cold, capture,,, Perhaps thats the natural outside lighting or you made it so ... maybe even the moons reflection off the swimming pool? My sick mind wants to see a witch riding a broom across the face of the moon. So its time to give this a nice vote and call it quits for the night.', '2004-04-15 06:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(669456, 69543, 15407, '<td valign="top">Great job of panning to get that window so sharp with a moving train! Too bad there isn''t an interesting character in the seat...</td>', 'Great job of panning to get that window so sharp with a moving train! Too bad there isn''t an interesting character in the seat...', '2004-04-15 06:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(669457, 69233, 15407, '<td valign="top">LOTS of contrast here!</td>', 'LOTS of contrast here!', '2004-04-15 06:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(669459, 69637, 15407, '<td valign="top">a motion blur perfectly framed would have been a 10!</td>', 'a motion blur perfectly framed would have been a 10!', '2004-04-15 06:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(669462, 69608, 15407, '<td valign="top">It looks like you had the light too bad the flowers don''t have a better focus.</td>', 'It looks like you had the light too bad the flowers don''t have a better focus.', '2004-04-15 06:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(669465, 69160, 15407, '<td valign="top">THis would look very nice printed on canvis stock. I like it!</td>', 'THis would look very nice printed on canvis stock. I like it!', '2004-04-15 06:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
