(669490, 69642, 15407, '<td valign="top">The leaning tower of Toronto</td>', 'The leaning tower of Toronto', '2004-04-15 07:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(669492, 69094, 15407, '<td valign="top">NOt my window... you have to PAY to get a view like that!</td>', 'NOt my window... you have to PAY to get a view like that!', '2004-04-15 07:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(669507, 69488, 15407, '<td valign="top">If there could have been a person gazing out from under the cloud on the far left window, the nicely composed picture may have been even more appealing to me.</td>', 'If there could have been a person gazing out from under the cloud on the far left window, the nicely composed picture may have been even more appealing to me.', '2004-04-15 07:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(669552, 69383, 15407, '<td valign="top">Since this view is of one of my favorite spots on earth I''ll just have to give it the highest vote. I lived 20 years of my life with this river in my backyard I hope to live the next 20 years with it in my back (or front yard). The dirt roads to the old fishing holes are now paved to subdivisions., no wonder - it''s God''s country! The best I can figure with this photo is that you put that window frame out near a great view of the river and snapped a fantastic shot !  If not &amp; you want to sell your house please do get in touch!  It still looks like GOD''s country to me... might this be just above Slab Creek Dam hard to tell withthis shot if its North or South of the river, perhaps as far east as Swansboro Country?</td>', 'Since this view is of one of my favorite spots on earth I''ll just have to give it the highest vote. I lived 20 years of my life with this river in my backyard I hope to live the next 20 years with it in my back (or front yard). The dirt roads to the old fishing holes are now paved to subdivisions., no wonder - it''s God''s country! The best I can figure with this photo is that you put that window frame out near a great view of the river and snapped a fantastic shot !  If not & you want to sell your house please do get in touch!  It still looks like GOD''s country to me... might this be just above Slab Creek Dam hard to tell withthis shot if its North or South of the river, perhaps as far east as Swansboro Country?', '2004-04-15 08:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(669555, 69115, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but the glass just doesn''t let any detail through to make the picture eye catching.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but the glass just doesn''t let any detail through to make the picture eye catching.', '2004-04-15 08:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(669556, 69554, 15920, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7, and would have scored it higher if the detail on the bricks wasn''t out of range.  The lighting and colors here are simply excellent.</td>', 'I gave this a 7, and would have scored it higher if the detail on the bricks wasn''t out of range.  The lighting and colors here are simply excellent.', '2004-04-15 08:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(669558, 68375, 15920, '<td valign="top">I can''t understand the red on her hand.  Otherwise, this is a great composition with lots of room for imagination.  You proably looked at this, but a little brighter might have worked as well.</td>', 'I can''t understand the red on her hand.  Otherwise, this is a great composition with lots of room for imagination.  You proably looked at this, but a little brighter might have worked as well.', '2004-04-15 08:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(669560, 69360, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection and colors, but the curvature of the window detracts a little</td>', 'Very nice reflection and colors, but the curvature of the window detracts a little', '2004-04-15 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(669564, 68948, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like the small reflections on the upper panes, but, the blown out highlights on the moon detract a bit.  Also, the frame is a little strong for a simple and clear image.</td>', 'I like the small reflections on the upper panes, but, the blown out highlights on the moon detract a bit.  Also, the frame is a little strong for a simple and clear image.', '2004-04-15 08:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(669566, 68873, 15920, '<td valign="top">I''m sure shooting through the peephole was hard, and you probably got all you could, but this could be a little sharper as a challenge entry.  As a photo, I have to admit that I laughed and found it really enjoyable.</td>', 'I''m sure shooting through the peephole was hard, and you probably got all you could, but this could be a little sharper as a challenge entry.  As a photo, I have to admit that I laughed and found it really enjoyable.', '2004-04-15 08:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
