(669596, 69319, 6130, '<td valign="top">Cute cat and pic.</td>', 'Cute cat and pic.', '2004-04-15 09:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(669599, 68414, 14603, '<td valign="top">Love the transition in the colour of the sky and the slight motion blurring.<br/>Don`t know if the window frame would have been more or less distracting than the reflections.<br/>Nice work..good luck</td>', 'Love the transition in the colour of the sky and the slight motion blurring.Don`t know if the window frame would have been more or less distracting than the reflections.Nice work..good luck', '2004-04-15 09:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(669619, 69540, 8522, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot, possibly looks a little too ''NeatImaged'' for me. Well exposed, bearing in mind the extremes of tones. I like the blurred figure. Atmospheric choice of colour. Effective composition.</td>', 'Intriguing shot, possibly looks a little too ''NeatImaged'' for me. Well exposed, bearing in mind the extremes of tones. I like the blurred figure. Atmospheric choice of colour. Effective composition.', '2004-04-15 09:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(669624, 69548, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you''re trying to achieve here. I feel like the shot is trying to tell a story, but it''s not clear enough. The view out of the window is too cluttered, and the reflections are very offputting. I don''t like that part of your model''s face has been cropped off.</td>', 'Not sure what you''re trying to achieve here. I feel like the shot is trying to tell a story, but it''s not clear enough. The view out of the window is too cluttered, and the reflections are very offputting. I don''t like that part of your model''s face has been cropped off.', '2004-04-15 09:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(669627, 69671, 14656, '<td valign="top">This shot is amazingly clear! How did you manage to capture this image? Loving it!</td>', 'This shot is amazingly clear! How did you manage to capture this image? Loving it!', '2004-04-15 09:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(669630, 69257, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection, I really like the effect here. I''m not sure about the diagonals in the composition though. I wonder what this might have looked like with the diagonals straightened using ''distort'' in Photoshop. Nice colours.</td>', 'Interesting reflection, I really like the effect here. I''m not sure about the diagonals in the composition though. I wonder what this might have looked like with the diagonals straightened using ''distort'' in Photoshop. Nice colours.', '2004-04-15 09:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(669632, 69618, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, what a huge shame about the burnt out highlights near the nose.</td>', 'Nice portrait, what a huge shame about the burnt out highlights near the nose.', '2004-04-15 09:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(669636, 69674, 8522, '<td valign="top">This picture is too symmetrical to sustain my interest.</td>', 'This picture is too symmetrical to sustain my interest.', '2004-04-15 09:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(669644, 69619, 8522, '<td valign="top">Are we looking though a window? The challenge stated that the frame had to be visible. Otherwise the window is a small one on the left of the frame which is definitely not the point of focus. This doesn''t meet the challenge for me.</td>', 'Are we looking though a window? The challenge stated that the frame had to be visible. Otherwise the window is a small one on the left of the frame which is definitely not the point of focus. This doesn''t meet the challenge for me.', '2004-04-15 09:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(669655, 69467, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great pic! Was this the image you were talking about that would''ve made a great entry in the Silhouettes challenge? Personally, I would''ve messed with the color balance and perhaps upped the saturation a tad. Even though the sun''s rays are brilliant, the sky and clouds still seem dull to me.</td>', 'Great pic! Was this the image you were talking about that would''ve made a great entry in the Silhouettes challenge? Personally, I would''ve messed with the color balance and perhaps upped the saturation a tad. Even though the sun''s rays are brilliant, the sky and clouds still seem dull to me.', '2004-04-15 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(669657, 69579, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what you were going for here, the overall effect is one of a snapshot. I think it''s the glare and reflections in the windows that let the photo down. It''s not entirely clear what your point of focus is... is it the woman looking in the window? The writing? The model in the poster? The arrangement of all these elements seems haphazard and not pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Not quite sure what you were going for here, the overall effect is one of a snapshot. I think it''s the glare and reflections in the windows that let the photo down. It''s not entirely clear what your point of focus is... is it the woman looking in the window? The writing? The model in the poster? The arrangement of all these elements seems haphazard and not pleasing to the eye.', '2004-04-15 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(669660, 69488, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some nice colours, textures and lines. But there''s not enough here to keep me interested, and the composition doesn''t convince me. The diverging diagonals seem badly thought out.</td>', 'Some nice colours, textures and lines. But there''s not enough here to keep me interested, and the composition doesn''t convince me. The diverging diagonals seem badly thought out.', '2004-04-15 09:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(669662, 69407, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some interesting textures and colours here. I''d have been tempted to make a tighter crop so you see the frame but not the lower right pane. Not enough sharpness here for my taste.</td>', 'Some interesting textures and colours here. I''d have been tempted to make a tighter crop so you see the frame but not the lower right pane. Not enough sharpness here for my taste.', '2004-04-15 09:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(669666, 69472, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some beautiful colours and lines here. I think the sky doesn''t quite do it for me though... this picture could be stunning with the right sky. The exposure is very effective leaving just the right amount of shadow detail.</td>', 'Some beautiful colours and lines here. I think the sky doesn''t quite do it for me though... this picture could be stunning with the right sky. The exposure is very effective leaving just the right amount of shadow detail.', '2004-04-15 09:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(669669, 69554, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some interesting elements here, but the overall effect is a bit chaotic. The burnt out highlights don''t work too well. I like the colours and textures. I''d have straightened everything in PS using ''distort'' so all the lines are parallel to the edge of the picture.</td>', 'Some interesting elements here, but the overall effect is a bit chaotic. The burnt out highlights don''t work too well. I like the colours and textures. I''d have straightened everything in PS using ''distort'' so all the lines are parallel to the edge of the picture.', '2004-04-15 09:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(669672, 69159, 14656, '<td valign="top">I love how each window frames the people on the outside. Not quite sure of what''s going on in the left panel. That gentleman in the darkness looks like he''s getting "serviced."</td>', 'I love how each window frames the people on the outside. Not quite sure of what''s going on in the left panel. That gentleman in the darkness looks like he''s getting "serviced."', '2004-04-15 09:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(669675, 69323, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful window and lovely colors!</td>', 'Beautiful window and lovely colors!', '2004-04-15 09:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(669677, 69611, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lemon tree, but the shot looks too much like a snapshot. How many shots did you try of this, using as many different angles as possible and at as many different times of the day for different light levels and colours as possible? The composition seems a bit haphazard... are the lines of the frame meant to be parallel to the edge of the picture? Is the centre of the cross meant to be on one of the junctions of thirds? The reflection on the right looks untidy.</td>', 'Beautiful lemon tree, but the shot looks too much like a snapshot. How many shots did you try of this, using as many different angles as possible and at as many different times of the day for different light levels and colours as possible? The composition seems a bit haphazard... are the lines of the frame meant to be parallel to the edge of the picture? Is the centre of the cross meant to be on one of the junctions of thirds? The reflection on the right looks untidy.', '2004-04-15 09:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(669680, 68948, 8522, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. The border is a little overbearing for the photo and draws my eye away from the delicate and subtle photo. The border has also gone a little wrong at the bottom on the lighter band near the left. Wonderful shadows. Great colours. Would have got one mark higher from me with a more effective and subtle border.</td>', 'Gorgeous. The border is a little overbearing for the photo and draws my eye away from the delicate and subtle photo. The border has also gone a little wrong at the bottom on the lighter band near the left. Wonderful shadows. Great colours. Would have got one mark higher from me with a more effective and subtle border.', '2004-04-15 09:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(669682, 69472, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines in your composition! Would have liked to see the levels upped to produce a slightly brighter image and adding a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful lines in your composition! Would have liked to see the levels upped to produce a slightly brighter image and adding a bit more contrast.', '2004-04-15 09:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(669683, 69582, 14656, '<td valign="top">How I would die for a view like that while washing dishes!</td>', 'How I would die for a view like that while washing dishes!', '2004-04-15 09:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(669684, 69542, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot to me. Loss of detail in the highlights in the sky, converging verticals in your window frame caused by not pointing the camera straight ahead, This could have been fixed by using ''Perspective'' in Photoshop. The overall shot needs more contrast IMO. It looks like you were aiming for the window panes to be symmetrical, but the right hand panes are too small here.</td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot to me. Loss of detail in the highlights in the sky, converging verticals in your window frame caused by not pointing the camera straight ahead, This could have been fixed by using ''Perspective'' in Photoshop. The overall shot needs more contrast IMO. It looks like you were aiming for the window panes to be symmetrical, but the right hand panes are too small here.', '2004-04-15 10:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(669686, 69653, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice... shame you weren''t a fraction lower so the bird was entirely in between the shutters. The narrow dof doesn''t work for me here... either less dof or much more is needed here I feel. I wish the bird was much sharper. I like the selective desat. The picture looks wonky to me, I''d have tried ''distort'' in Photoshop to get everything straight. I''m not sure the centred composition works here.</td>', 'Very nice... shame you weren''t a fraction lower so the bird was entirely in between the shutters. The narrow dof doesn''t work for me here... either less dof or much more is needed here I feel. I wish the bird was much sharper. I like the selective desat. The picture looks wonky to me, I''d have tried ''distort'' in Photoshop to get everything straight. I''m not sure the centred composition works here.', '2004-04-15 10:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(669691, 69042, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice cat shot, but several things let it down. The noise levels are terrible, possibly caused because it is too dark. This has also affected the saturation levels, which seems a but washed out to me. The shot is not sharp enough. It''s a shame the windowframe isn''t parallel to the edge of the picture. The cat''s expression is great though.</td>', 'Nice cat shot, but several things let it down. The noise levels are terrible, possibly caused because it is too dark. This has also affected the saturation levels, which seems a but washed out to me. The shot is not sharp enough. It''s a shame the windowframe isn''t parallel to the edge of the picture. The cat''s expression is great though.', '2004-04-15 10:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(669693, 69531, 8522, '<td valign="top">Why the red line? All it does is draw attention to the fact that the window wasn''t taken straight on and hasn''t been straightened in Photoshop.</td>', 'Why the red line? All it does is draw attention to the fact that the window wasn''t taken straight on and hasn''t been straightened in Photoshop.', '2004-04-15 10:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(669695, 69134, 18219, '<td valign="top">Nice.<br/>I would have preferred it in B/W.<br/>But that''s just me-7</td>', 'Nice.I would have preferred it in B/W.But that''s just me-7', '2004-04-15 10:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(669698, 69618, 18219, '<td valign="top">Can''t see a view!</td>', 'Can''t see a view!', '2004-04-15 10:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(669700, 69664, 18219, '<td valign="top">Can''t see a view!</td>', 'Can''t see a view!', '2004-04-15 10:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(669701, 69641, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened.</td>', 'Oversharpened.', '2004-04-15 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(669702, 69257, 18219, '<td valign="top">Like it very much-8</td>', 'Like it very much-8', '2004-04-15 10:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(669703, 69233, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, shame it''s wonky. Try using ''distort'' or ''perspective'' in Photoshop.</td>', 'Great shot, shame it''s wonky. Try using ''distort'' or ''perspective'' in Photoshop.', '2004-04-15 10:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(669705, 68944, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame the horizon isn''t level. Great colours.</td>', 'Shame the horizon isn''t level. Great colours.', '2004-04-15 10:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(669709, 69544, 8522, '<td valign="top">If there''s more than meets the eye, I don''t get it. Seems badly oversharpened.</td>', 'If there''s more than meets the eye, I don''t get it. Seems badly oversharpened.', '2004-04-15 10:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(669710, 68820, 8522, '<td valign="top">Compositionally seems chaotic and messy. No clear point of focus.</td>', 'Compositionally seems chaotic and messy. No clear point of focus.', '2004-04-15 10:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(669712, 69094, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely view, very lush. I wish the photo were sharper.</td>', 'Lovely view, very lush. I wish the photo were sharper.', '2004-04-15 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(669716, 69621, 8522, '<td valign="top">I think your sepia effect has gone a bit wrong... there''s too much red and too much saturation.</td>', 'I think your sepia effect has gone a bit wrong... there''s too much red and too much saturation.', '2004-04-15 10:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(669719, 68397, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, great expression captured of the guy on the right. This picture certainly tells a story. Difficult exposure, and handled well here. Effective composition. I like this photo a lot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, great expression captured of the guy on the right. This picture certainly tells a story. Difficult exposure, and handled well here. Effective composition. I like this photo a lot.', '2004-04-15 10:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(669735, 69256, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and a creative capture.</td>', 'Very pretty and a creative capture.', '2004-04-15 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(669742, 69506, 8367, '<td valign="top">Very nice view and capture. Colors are great.</td>', 'Very nice view and capture. Colors are great.', '2004-04-15 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(669746, 69255, 3569, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and shades</td>', 'excellent lighting and shades', '2004-04-15 10:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(669747, 69407, 8367, '<td valign="top">Good job. Very nice colors and a good view to capture. I love the look of older homes. They have such character.</td>', 'Good job. Very nice colors and a good view to capture. I love the look of older homes. They have such character.', '2004-04-15 10:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(669750, 69160, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice dogwoods</td>', 'nice dogwoods', '2004-04-15 10:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(669774, 68785, 8522, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot, shame there''s loss of detail in the highlights and shadows. Is your camera set on it''s lowest contrast setting? Great idea and mood, the selective desat works well. Huge shame that there is such a loss of detail in the shadows where the point of focus is.</td>', 'Intriguing shot, shame there''s loss of detail in the highlights and shadows. Is your camera set on it''s lowest contrast setting? Great idea and mood, the selective desat works well. Huge shame that there is such a loss of detail in the shadows where the point of focus is.', '2004-04-15 11:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(669778, 69518, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the burnt out highlights. Great shot, good detail.</td>', 'Shame about the burnt out highlights. Great shot, good detail.', '2004-04-15 11:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(669780, 69547, 8522, '<td valign="top">This may have been from your car, but the challenge asked for a window frame to prove that the shot was taken through a window. This doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'This may have been from your car, but the challenge asked for a window frame to prove that the shot was taken through a window. This doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2004-04-15 11:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(669789, 69040, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened.</td>', 'Oversharpened.', '2004-04-15 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(669794, 69677, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice title that fits the photo. I really like the idea of this composition  but I think there''s too much space in the middle or maybe more space at the top would help.  I like the angle of the window pane. You might try this in black and white.</td>', 'Nice title that fits the photo. I really like the idea of this composition  but I think there''s too much space in the middle or maybe more space at the top would help.  I like the angle of the window pane. You might try this in black and white.', '2004-04-15 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(669798, 68551, 8522, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, but shame you''ve oversharpened. You could have cloned or cropped out the edge of the window in the top left of the frame. Saturation is also a bit much, especially in the yellows.</td>', 'Really nice shot, but shame you''ve oversharpened. You could have cloned or cropped out the edge of the window in the top left of the frame. Saturation is also a bit much, especially in the yellows.', '2004-04-15 11:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(669819, 69348, 6073, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture, but for it to score higher you would need to include the full frame of the window.  You have it on the bottom and left, but that''s it.  This looks sorta fake.  I''m also not sure where the focal point is as it appears a bit soft.  Again..great picture, but I think it''s being held back a little.  The lighting is great.</td>', 'This is a good picture, but for it to score higher you would need to include the full frame of the window.  You have it on the bottom and left, but that''s it.  This looks sorta fake.  I''m also not sure where the focal point is as it appears a bit soft.  Again..great picture, but I think it''s being held back a little.  The lighting is great.', '2004-04-15 11:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(669821, 69498, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great color but I"m not sure I like the window frame dead on the diagnal center.</td>', 'Great color but I"m not sure I like the window frame dead on the diagnal center.', '2004-04-15 11:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(669848, 69518, 6073, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot.  It''s sorta like an intimate portrait.  You are catching something the dog is doing naturally, and he isn''t focused on the camera.  B &amp; W is an excellent choice here as well.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a really good shot.  It''s sorta like an intimate portrait.  You are catching something the dog is doing naturally, and he isn''t focused on the camera.  B & W is an excellent choice here as well.  Well done.', '2004-04-15 11:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(669853, 68820, 6073, '<td valign="top">If your getting crushed in the voting, its because we cannot see the window frames.  Where is the window?   The subject is very distracting and there isn''t a clear area of focus.</td>', 'If your getting crushed in the voting, its because we cannot see the window frames.  Where is the window?   The subject is very distracting and there isn''t a clear area of focus.', '2004-04-15 11:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(669858, 68871, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the tones and the scene but think the horizon is just tilted a wee bit left.</td>', 'Love the tones and the scene but think the horizon is just tilted a wee bit left.', '2004-04-15 11:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(669859, 69236, 6073, '<td valign="top">Personal opinion here.  The top third of the pic is excellent.  With the window frame, this looks like a picture hung on the wall.  With the lower 3rd, this starts to look strange.  Kinda like it doesn''t belong.  Maybe you included because you wanted to prove this was taken from a window in a class room?  I think we would have believed you with just the window frame.  The uneven lighting in the room is distracting, and pulls from the key subject area.  A tighter crop would have scored you much higher.  Best ~ d</td>', 'Personal opinion here.  The top third of the pic is excellent.  With the window frame, this looks like a picture hung on the wall.  With the lower 3rd, this starts to look strange.  Kinda like it doesn''t belong.  Maybe you included because you wanted to prove this was taken from a window in a class room?  I think we would have believed you with just the window frame.  The uneven lighting in the room is distracting, and pulls from the key subject area.  A tighter crop would have scored you much higher.  Best ~ d', '2004-04-15 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(669867, 68375, 6073, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the red on the hand is freaking me out a little.  I''m not sure what to think or even if I am suppose to think about it.  It''s almost a little disturbing.  Same shot with a little more clarity on the body parts would have been great.</td>', 'Great idea, but the red on the hand is freaking me out a little.  I''m not sure what to think or even if I am suppose to think about it.  It''s almost a little disturbing.  Same shot with a little more clarity on the body parts would have been great.', '2004-04-15 11:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(669912, 69678, 6073, '<td valign="top">This is a better picture without the person in the background.</td>', 'This is a better picture without the person in the background.', '2004-04-15 12:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(669913, 69678, 5822, '<td valign="top">The rustic window frame is very appealing but your background view is plain. The silhouette looks more like a black blob without much definition.  Also, do I see some noise in the shadowed areas of the wooden frame?</td>', 'The rustic window frame is very appealing but your background view is plain. The silhouette looks more like a black blob without much definition.  Also, do I see some noise in the shadowed areas of the wooden frame?', '2004-04-15 12:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(669944, 69042, 17166, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I''m giving a cat photo a 10, but this is such a great picture.  The soft focus, expression, hint of blue in his (her?) eye, and the title all come together here.</td>', 'I can''t believe I''m giving a cat photo a 10, but this is such a great picture.  The soft focus, expression, hint of blue in his (her?) eye, and the title all come together here.', '2004-04-15 12:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(669946, 69028, 17166, '<td valign="top">Great framing</td>', 'Great framing', '2004-04-15 12:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(669947, 69656, 6073, '<td valign="top">This is really well done.  B &amp; W use is perfect for this spot.  Great use of Foreground and key subject.  High marks</td>', 'This is really well done.  B & W use is perfect for this spot.  Great use of Foreground and key subject.  High marks', '2004-04-15 12:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(669948, 69535, 17166, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition.  Wish the highlights weren''t so blown out.</td>', 'Fantastic composition.  Wish the highlights weren''t so blown out.', '2004-04-15 12:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(669950, 69134, 17166, '<td valign="top">One of the things I''ve looked for in this challenge are photos where the window view enhances the whole image, rather than just being a gratuitous window.  Yours is the best example of this that I''ve seen yet - the rough opening really compliments the ruin.</td>', 'One of the things I''ve looked for in this challenge are photos where the window view enhances the whole image, rather than just being a gratuitous window.  Yours is the best example of this that I''ve seen yet - the rough opening really compliments the ruin.', '2004-04-15 12:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(670066, 69681, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and subject - I wish it were slightly more saturated, but I realize that may be the reality of the type of window and perhaps you don''t want to stray to far from what it actually looked like. I like that the window is dirty though</td>', 'I like the composition and subject - I wish it were slightly more saturated, but I realize that may be the reality of the type of window and perhaps you don''t want to stray to far from what it actually looked like. I like that the window is dirty though', '2004-04-15 13:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(670069, 69518, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of this photo and the contrast/balance, it''s well composed and really gives the sense of a window being a barrier and as well as allowing a glimpse of what you''re being kept from</td>', 'I love the crispness of this photo and the contrast/balance, it''s well composed and really gives the sense of a window being a barrier and as well as allowing a glimpse of what you''re being kept from', '2004-04-15 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(670071, 69644, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the photo, but the photoshop work is subpar and distracts from the work as a whole</td>', 'I like the idea of the photo, but the photoshop work is subpar and distracts from the work as a whole', '2004-04-15 13:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(670076, 69548, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and of course the idea of the photo, the subject of the older car provides more interest. I found the woman''s arm position a little distracting, as if she was not comfortable (it''s like she bracing herself) which is too bad because I enjoy a person in this shot, I think it adds context</td>', 'I like the framing and of course the idea of the photo, the subject of the older car provides more interest. I found the woman''s arm position a little distracting, as if she was not comfortable (it''s like she bracing herself) which is too bad because I enjoy a person in this shot, I think it adds context', '2004-04-15 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(670078, 69515, 19780, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the use of sepia in this photo, it enhances the overall feeling of decay. Well composed.</td>', 'I enjoy the use of sepia in this photo, it enhances the overall feeling of decay. Well composed.', '2004-04-15 13:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(670083, 69582, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a great view. A wonderful sunset with great colors. I find the fill flash reflection on the counter a bit distracting though.</td>', 'What a great view. A wonderful sunset with great colors. I find the fill flash reflection on the counter a bit distracting though.', '2004-04-15 13:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(670085, 69465, 19780, '<td valign="top">this photo is a riot of lines and works well to present the subject of windows and the mirror view really adds to it. The lines on the asphalt really add to the composition.</td>', 'this photo is a riot of lines and works well to present the subject of windows and the mirror view really adds to it. The lines on the asphalt really add to the composition.', '2004-04-15 13:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(670090, 69312, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and subject.  I like the slight angle of the window frame.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and subject.  I like the slight angle of the window frame.', '2004-04-15 13:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(670092, 69115, 19780, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture. As the challenge was window view, I would have liked to have seen what this texture would do to something on the other side</td>', 'Interesting texture. As the challenge was window view, I would have liked to have seen what this texture would do to something on the other side', '2004-04-15 13:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(670094, 69674, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, texture and colors.</td>', 'I like the composition, texture and colors.', '2004-04-15 13:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(670098, 69472, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, composition and crispness. I like the variations of the cables and other lines, instead of it being completely symmetrical.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, composition and crispness. I like the variations of the cables and other lines, instead of it being completely symmetrical.', '2004-04-15 13:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(670103, 69673, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this photo but the composition lacks a little bit, I''d like to see the dog slightly more to the right so that more of the view is revealed and more detail on the dog''s head. It''s a wonderfully conceived idea, because we all understand the excitement a dog has looking out a car window.</td>', 'I like the idea of this photo but the composition lacks a little bit, I''d like to see the dog slightly more to the right so that more of the view is revealed and more detail on the dog''s head. It''s a wonderfully conceived idea, because we all understand the excitement a dog has looking out a car window.', '2004-04-15 13:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(670204, 69134, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting on the old building.  The out of focus frame nd forground detracts  - did you use a tripod and stop the lens down?  The sky doesn''t help this umage either.  A bluer sky would help the golden-lit building really pop.</td>', 'Excellent lighting on the old building.  The out of focus frame nd forground detracts  - did you use a tripod and stop the lens down?  The sky doesn''t help this umage either.  A bluer sky would help the golden-lit building really pop.', '2004-04-15 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(670209, 68624, 19608, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9 initially... but on my second pass, decided it was a 10.  The only problem I have is the telephone line reflections.  The peeling paint works extremely well.</td>', 'I gave this a 9 initially... but on my second pass, decided it was a 10.  The only problem I have is the telephone line reflections.  The peeling paint works extremely well.', '2004-04-15 14:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(670216, 69216, 19608, '<td valign="top">Background is a bit hot and pulls you away from the boy.  Nice expression on the model.  I''m not exactly sure what the title is supposed to mean.</td>', 'Background is a bit hot and pulls you away from the boy.  Nice expression on the model.  I''m not exactly sure what the title is supposed to mean.', '2004-04-15 14:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(670221, 69467, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing on a beautiful afternoon.  Did you also try hiding more of the ultra-bright sky behind the frame?</td>', 'Excellent framing on a beautiful afternoon.  Did you also try hiding more of the ultra-bright sky behind the frame?', '2004-04-15 14:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(670233, 69528, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors are very nice as is the composition.  Great detail on the leaf.</td>', 'Colors are very nice as is the composition.  Great detail on the leaf.', '2004-04-15 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(670235, 69042, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Good catchlight in the cat''s eye.  The fur tends to have a yellowish hue - which detracts for me.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Good catchlight in the cat''s eye.  The fur tends to have a yellowish hue - which detracts for me.', '2004-04-15 14:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(670249, 68967, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice find - and the" two for one" title is catchy.  To me, the overall photo lacks impact - mostly because the end view through window #2 is pretty busy and doesn''t reall have a "subject."  There''s also some composition issue such as the "border areas:"  1) The slim area on the very top left of the frame should be eliminated, 2) The white board in the top right of the frame leads you out of the frame  (And since we should probably see more of the bottom of window #1 - maybe just moving the camera down a bit would be the thing to do.).  Finally - it would be helpful if there were some texture in the area inside the building.  Was there a way to get some light reflected in there?  I know this is a lot of info - but hope it heps.</td>', 'Nice find - and the" two for one" title is catchy.  To me, the overall photo lacks impact - mostly because the end view through window #2 is pretty busy and doesn''t reall have a "subject."  There''s also some composition issue such as the "border areas:"  1) The slim area on the very top left of the frame should be eliminated, 2) The white board in the top right of the frame leads you out of the frame  (And since we should probably see more of the bottom of window #1 - maybe just moving the camera down a bit would be the thing to do.).  Finally - it would be helpful if there were some texture in the area inside the building.  Was there a way to get some light reflected in there?  I know this is a lot of info - but hope it heps.', '2004-04-15 14:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(670254, 69259, 19608, '<td valign="top">The orange color is striking.  I''d like to see a bit more of the basket holding the flowers by moveing the camera left a bit.  It would have really popped the image if the green areas of the flowers were a bit more vivid.</td>', 'The orange color is striking.  I''d like to see a bit more of the basket holding the flowers by moveing the camera left a bit.  It would have really popped the image if the green areas of the flowers were a bit more vivid.', '2004-04-15 14:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(670256, 69037, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors work well.  No window frame showing, but I guess the beveled edge of the glass is "almost" a window frame.</td>', 'Colors work well.  No window frame showing, but I guess the beveled edge of the glass is "almost" a window frame.', '2004-04-15 14:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(670259, 69681, 19608, '<td valign="top">The dirty glass adds a lot to this image.  Because of the framing the picture seems to be off horizontal.  My eye wants to rotate the image counter-clockwise a bit.</td>', 'The dirty glass adds a lot to this image.  Because of the framing the picture seems to be off horizontal.  My eye wants to rotate the image counter-clockwise a bit.', '2004-04-15 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(670276, 69523, 17166, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this better if the cat was looking straight out or at the yellow tree - need to train him/her better :).  Nice photo, though.</td>', 'Would have liked this better if the cat was looking straight out or at the yellow tree - need to train him/her better :).  Nice photo, though.', '2004-04-15 14:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(670282, 69159, 17166, '<td valign="top">Wow - fantastic composition.  I really like how each window frames a different scene/story.</td>', 'Wow - fantastic composition.  I really like how each window frames a different scene/story.', '2004-04-15 14:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(670326, 69308, 20056, '<td valign="top">If I could vote I would give You a 10...   Did You wash the car on purpose? very nice reflextions, maybe I would remove the point in the infinite</td>', 'If I could vote I would give You a 10...   Did You wash the car on purpose? very nice reflextions, maybe I would remove the point in the infinite', '2004-04-15 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(670339, 69323, 20056, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites... only missing Dali''s wife :)<br/>Maybe it will be even better on days without fog.</td>', 'One of my favorites... only missing Dali''s wife :)Maybe it will be even better on days without fog.', '2004-04-15 15:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(670346, 69515, 20056, '<td valign="top">Perfect dimensions for the window .</td>', 'Perfect dimensions for the window .', '2004-04-15 15:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(670400, 69582, 2302, '<td valign="top">A closer crop would have helped here - too many distracting elements in the foreground.</td>', 'A closer crop would have helped here - too many distracting elements in the foreground.', '2004-04-15 15:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(670715, 69653, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastique!</td>', 'Fantastique!', '2004-04-15 18:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(670718, 69624, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great! This is one of my top scorers in this challenge!!! My fingers are crossed for you, if this doesn''t ribbon I will become a monk :)</td>', 'Great! This is one of my top scorers in this challenge!!! My fingers are crossed for you, if this doesn''t ribbon I will become a monk :)', '2004-04-15 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(670825, 69556, 15407, '<td valign="top">Pople sometimes suggest that I ''clone out or otherwise eliminat an item in the photo I sometimes give it a try- and as often as not I think that they were right ... not always though!  I like this shot very much. I believe that I would have liked it better with the tallest of the flowers and its stem removed - perhaps with post processing software.  In any event it''s one of my favorites just like it is.</td>', 'Pople sometimes suggest that I ''clone out or otherwise eliminat an item in the photo I sometimes give it a try- and as often as not I think that they were right ... not always though!  I like this shot very much. I believe that I would have liked it better with the tallest of the flowers and its stem removed - perhaps with post processing software.  In any event it''s one of my favorites just like it is.', '2004-04-15 19:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(670828, 69395, 15407, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and the lighting was a challenge in its own right. You did well with what you had to work with.</td>', 'Nicely composed and the lighting was a challenge in its own right. You did well with what you had to work with.', '2004-04-15 19:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
