(671105, 69678, 16075, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much...nice lighting and very well composed, as well as a very interesting subject.</td>', 'I like this photo very much...nice lighting and very well composed, as well as a very interesting subject.', '2004-04-15 23:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
