(671117, 69637, 6073, '<td valign="top">Your view kinda sucks.  Nothing personal, but the framing around the window and the lighting is very strong.  The actual view kinda sucks.</td>', 'Your view kinda sucks.  Nothing personal, but the framing around the window and the lighting is very strong.  The actual view kinda sucks.', '2004-04-15 23:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(671121, 69608, 12131, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  I don''t know if it would make it better or worse, but I would also like to see the flower in focus with the rusted chair out of focus.  Still.  I like the blend of old and new. 9</td>', 'I really like this one.  I don''t know if it would make it better or worse, but I would also like to see the flower in focus with the rusted chair out of focus.  Still.  I like the blend of old and new. 9', '2004-04-15 23:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(671123, 69589, 12131, '<td valign="top">I love the statue at the front of that.  Very interesting.  If anything, it seems a little too framed.  Maybe lighten up on the sides, or come in closer to the window.  Still great focus.</td>', 'I love the statue at the front of that.  Very interesting.  If anything, it seems a little too framed.  Maybe lighten up on the sides, or come in closer to the window.  Still great focus.', '2004-04-15 23:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(671125, 68871, 6073, '<td valign="top">Good things = Window Frame - Subject - B &amp; W <br/>Bad things = Tilt ...too far left and to the bottom..... Defocus on right side of path.<br/>Why is that path so blurry?</td>', 'Good things = Window Frame - Subject - B & W Bad things = Tilt ...too far left and to the bottom..... Defocus on right side of path.Why is that path so blurry?', '2004-04-15 23:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(671126, 69630, 12131, '<td valign="top">I''d certainly like the drive by there.</td>', 'I''d certainly like the drive by there.', '2004-04-15 23:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(671128, 68551, 12131, '<td valign="top">Lovely city scape.  Especially like that you didn''t get that much of the wing in the picture.  It''s a distraction in the others.  Amazingly crisp. 10</td>', 'Lovely city scape.  Especially like that you didn''t get that much of the wing in the picture.  It''s a distraction in the others.  Amazingly crisp. 10', '2004-04-15 23:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
