(674014, 69115, 11897, '<td valign="top">no view here !</td>', 'no view here !', '2004-04-18 14:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(674015, 69677, 11897, '<td valign="top">too grainy.</td>', 'too grainy.', '2004-04-18 14:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(674205, 68375, 11897, '<td valign="top">sorry, I just don''t like gory images here.<br/>I appreciate the technical side of the image and have voted accordingly.</td>', 'sorry, I just don''t like gory images here.I appreciate the technical side of the image and have voted accordingly.', '2004-04-18 19:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(674215, 69639, 9668, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the flower more centered, frames seem a little tilted to the right. I like the idea of it all being blurry except from the flower.</td>', 'I would like to see the flower more centered, frames seem a little tilted to the right. I like the idea of it all being blurry except from the flower.', '2004-04-18 19:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(674216, 69644, 9668, '<td valign="top">It looks like a selection tool has been used (the edge of the steering wheel) even though it has been validated. Nice color and composition.</td>', 'It looks like a selection tool has been used (the edge of the steering wheel) even though it has been validated. Nice color and composition.', '2004-04-18 19:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(674221, 69629, 9668, '<td valign="top">Freaky!<br/>Cool idea, well done. Inside seems a bit noisy, the light (?) distacts attention.</td>', 'Freaky!Cool idea, well done. Inside seems a bit noisy, the light (?) distacts attention.', '2004-04-18 19:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(674255, 69132, 12131, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I gave it a ten because I like the focus, the color, the shape of the window (or should I say windows?) and the crescent moon in the top center.  The only thing that bothers me is that the crescent is not competely dead center.  Still this rates  a 10.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I gave it a ten because I like the focus, the color, the shape of the window (or should I say windows?) and the crescent moon in the top center.  The only thing that bothers me is that the crescent is not competely dead center.  Still this rates  a 10.', '2004-04-18 21:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(674256, 69556, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is fine shot but it is a shot taken OF a window not FROM a window. Ah me what to do....well I give it a good score cause it is very good and you used a great angle but jeez read the challenge a little closer, please?</td>', 'This is fine shot but it is a shot taken OF a window not FROM a window. Ah me what to do....well I give it a good score cause it is very good and you used a great angle but jeez read the challenge a little closer, please?', '2004-04-18 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(674265, 69360, 8891, '<td valign="top">A little perspective work might have helped this a bit.  Not sure what the crop is about.  the campus is a little to shadowy for this to be real effective but I like reflection shots. It appears you did what you could with the contrast difference between  the reflection and the window hardware without one being blown out so good job.</td>', 'A little perspective work might have helped this a bit.  Not sure what the crop is about.  the campus is a little to shadowy for this to be real effective but I like reflection shots. It appears you did what you could with the contrast difference between  the reflection and the window hardware without one being blown out so good job.', '2004-04-18 21:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(674268, 69676, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great expsure and colors outside but the scene outside is mediocre.</td>', 'Great expsure and colors outside but the scene outside is mediocre.', '2004-04-18 21:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(674273, 69653, 8891, '<td valign="top">Should have pulled the blinds up.</td>', 'Should have pulled the blinds up.', '2004-04-18 21:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(674275, 69618, 8891, '<td valign="top">Ahhh isn''t that cute.....FROM a window not OF a window.</td>', 'Ahhh isn''t that cute.....FROM a window not OF a window.', '2004-04-18 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(674278, 69132, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice the way you aligned this.</td>', 'Very nice the way you aligned this.', '2004-04-18 21:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(674279, 69671, 8891, '<td valign="top">Too much emphasis on the the car and not the view which is more interesting to me than the dials.</td>', 'Too much emphasis on the the car and not the view which is more interesting to me than the dials.', '2004-04-18 21:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(674281, 69548, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very nice...like the double view of the car. Like it very much.</td>', 'Very nice...like the double view of the car. Like it very much.', '2004-04-18 21:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(674283, 69518, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the way he/she looks a bit like a drawing in this.  IMHO I would have fixed the perspective to straighten the window frame.</td>', 'I like the way he/she looks a bit like a drawing in this.  IMHO I would have fixed the perspective to straighten the window frame.', '2004-04-18 21:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(674285, 69042, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice; I think it might have been improved a little by straigtening (the window tilts left) and noise reduction--there''s a lot of color noise in this.</td>', 'Nice; I think it might have been improved a little by straigtening (the window tilts left) and noise reduction--there''s a lot of color noise in this.', '2004-04-18 21:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(674288, 69256, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great, creative,  idea.  I think it would have been even better if you managed to get the lines of the window sharp too</td>', 'Great, creative,  idea.  I think it would have been even better if you managed to get the lines of the window sharp too', '2004-04-18 21:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(674291, 69639, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Good idea.  I think it would have been better if I could see the whole flower in the middle.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Good idea.  I think it would have been better if I could see the whole flower in the middle.', '2004-04-18 21:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(674302, 69234, 8891, '<td valign="top">would have liked it better if the title was "My Need Bandaid", Just joking....old family joke.....anyway the focus is off the top of the chimps and I would like to have seen it clearer than it is.  Nice composition and effort.</td>', 'would have liked it better if the title was "My Need Bandaid", Just joking....old family joke.....anyway the focus is off the top of the chimps and I would like to have seen it clearer than it is.  Nice composition and effort.', '2004-04-18 21:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(674304, 69619, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very good eye to have seen this, but I wish, the window view being theme, that there was more window and less gallery.  Nice exposure and shot.</td>', 'Very good eye to have seen this, but I wish, the window view being theme, that there was more window and less gallery.  Nice exposure and shot.', '2004-04-18 21:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(674306, 69319, 8891, '<td valign="top">Clean the window.</td>', 'Clean the window.', '2004-04-18 21:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(674320, 69669, 1031, '<td valign="top">And not too shy about it either. Of course, in this situation, the person with the camera is usually outside the window ...</td>', 'And not too shy about it either. Of course, in this situation, the person with the camera is usually outside the window ...', '2004-04-18 22:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(674322, 69515, 5213, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2004-04-18 22:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(674327, 69591, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the triptych effect of this shot; but I think it''s marred a bit by the loose blindes to the left of the center and left panels. I think if they were tucked over tightly against the sides of the windows the effect would be stronger. I like the lighting and mood; would probably look good in B+W as well.</td>', 'I like the triptych effect of this shot; but I think it''s marred a bit by the loose blindes to the left of the center and left panels. I think if they were tucked over tightly against the sides of the windows the effect would be stronger. I like the lighting and mood; would probably look good in B+W as well.', '2004-04-18 22:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(674330, 69624, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the color and tone and the foggy background.</td>', 'I like the color and tone and the foggy background.', '2004-04-18 22:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(674344, 69111, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the wall and the contents of the windows.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the wall and the contents of the windows.', '2004-04-18 22:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(674345, 69624, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent work... I like a photo that generates some ''tension'' and this one does that nicely by making me wonder what is visible outside the window.  The darkness of the image lead me to believe that whatever is being viewed is not good or ''evil'' in some way... great shot :) = 10</td>', 'Excellent work... I like a photo that generates some ''tension'' and this one does that nicely by making me wonder what is visible outside the window.  The darkness of the image lead me to believe that whatever is being viewed is not good or ''evil'' in some way... great shot :) = 10', '2004-04-18 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(674346, 69233, 1031, '<td valign="top">Tricky angles ... with unlimited editing here I might have tried using perspective correction to get more of the major elements closer to vertical. Good exposure/tone range and DOF.</td>', 'Tricky angles ... with unlimited editing here I might have tried using perspective correction to get more of the major elements closer to vertical. Good exposure/tone range and DOF.', '2004-04-18 22:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(674349, 69641, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks a lot like a movie I saw (late) last night, "Teenagers From Outer Space" --  nice use of extreme tone range and (possibly) oversharpening to create a particular mood.</td>', 'Looks a lot like a movie I saw (late) last night, "Teenagers From Outer Space" --  nice use of extreme tone range and (possibly) oversharpening to create a particular mood.', '2004-04-18 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(674352, 69028, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nicely layered composition; good exposure.</td>', 'Nicely layered composition; good exposure.', '2004-04-18 22:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(674369, 69308, 2309, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, great view. The car itself could be a little sharper, but overall I still love it.</td>', 'I really like this photo, great view. The car itself could be a little sharper, but overall I still love it.', '2004-04-18 23:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(674371, 69624, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great off-centered composition. Beautiful gray/blue tone. The "peeking out" idea is well displayed here.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Great off-centered composition. Beautiful gray/blue tone. The "peeking out" idea is well displayed here. Good luck...', '2004-04-18 23:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(674377, 69671, 3306, '<td valign="top">Gutsy</td>', 'Gutsy', '2004-04-18 23:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(674379, 69319, 3306, '<td valign="top">My Favorite of the challenge. Great shot.</td>', 'My Favorite of the challenge. Great shot.', '2004-04-18 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(674381, 69540, 16301, '<td valign="top">Really great composition, off-centering the person. I like the idea, I think its very original. B&amp;W would have looked better than the yellow tone. The white line in the border is too thick though. Its still a nice photo.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Really great composition, off-centering the person. I like the idea, I think its very original. B&W would have looked better than the yellow tone. The white line in the border is too thick though. Its still a nice photo. Good luck...', '2004-04-18 23:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(674384, 69407, 12253, '<td valign="top">The rain is great and makes the scene very impressionistic. I am not fond of the break for the vertical window pane wood; perhaps there was no way around it.  I would have loved to see it framed by the wood and the beautiful scene within.</td>', 'The rain is great and makes the scene very impressionistic. I am not fond of the break for the vertical window pane wood; perhaps there was no way around it.  I would have loved to see it framed by the wood and the beautiful scene within.', '2004-04-18 23:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(674385, 69677, 12253, '<td valign="top">Looks like it was taken at night... too much noise/color noise!  Aside from that, it''s not even too clear we are looking out a window, though I suppose that''s the frame vertically?</td>', 'Looks like it was taken at night... too much noise/color noise!  Aside from that, it''s not even too clear we are looking out a window, though I suppose that''s the frame vertically?', '2004-04-18 23:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(674386, 69535, 16301, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, off-centering the child. The tone is really good. The brightness outside takes away some detail from the view (building &amp; tree). Its still a very good photo.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'I really like the composition, off-centering the child. The tone is really good. The brightness outside takes away some detail from the view (building & tree). Its still a very good photo. Good luck...', '2004-04-18 23:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(674387, 69547, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty lights. Looks slightly tilted to me, but it might be an optical illusion.</td>', 'Pretty lights. Looks slightly tilted to me, but it might be an optical illusion.', '2004-04-18 23:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(674388, 69439, 16301, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the lightning and the color of the sky. I think the reflections on the glass are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'I like how you captured the lightning and the color of the sky. I think the reflections on the glass are somewhat distracting.', '2004-04-18 23:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(674389, 69610, 12253, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice window view, but the blinds don''t really add here.  The sun could look better too--if you use your highest aperature, on a digital camera you would have gotten a star effect; but I think your window view woud have looked great on a rainy day, or a foggy day, or early am with some interesting light through the trees but not the sun dead on.  Also, a polarizer would eliminate the reflections (looks like a cup reflecting).</td>', 'Looks like a nice window view, but the blinds don''t really add here.  The sun could look better too--if you use your highest aperature, on a digital camera you would have gotten a star effect; but I think your window view woud have looked great on a rainy day, or a foggy day, or early am with some interesting light through the trees but not the sun dead on.  Also, a polarizer would eliminate the reflections (looks like a cup reflecting).', '2004-04-18 23:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(674390, 68983, 1031, '<td valign="top">A different approach to the challenge, with the view throught the window OOF.</td>', 'A different approach to the challenge, with the view throught the window OOF.', '2004-04-18 23:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(674391, 69579, 14863, '<td valign="top">Aww, this is really touch i ng, i really like this. the b &amp; w works great here</td>', 'Aww, this is really touch i ng, i really like this. the b & w works great here', '2004-04-18 23:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(674393, 69674, 12253, '<td valign="top">Makes an interesting abstract but not much view through this window.  I like the tilt here.</td>', 'Makes an interesting abstract but not much view through this window.  I like the tilt here.', '2004-04-18 23:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(674394, 69439, 14863, '<td valign="top">Cool! This is awesome! I love the blue of the lightening- SO  COOL! 10</td>', 'Cool! This is awesome! I love the blue of the lightening- SO  COOL! 10', '2004-04-18 23:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(674396, 68873, 14863, '<td valign="top">A little blurry but still very interesting- I like  your creativity- 8</td>', 'A little blurry but still very interesting- I like  your creativity- 8', '2004-04-18 23:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(674399, 69159, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot through the glass; I like the view and particularly the sillouetted fellow.  If you could have done a bit of staging, putting someone interesting to sillouette in each window, you''d have a winner for that upcoming challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot through the glass; I like the view and particularly the sillouetted fellow.  If you could have done a bit of staging, putting someone interesting to sillouette in each window, you''d have a winner for that upcoming challenge.', '2004-04-18 23:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(674401, 69651, 1031, '<td valign="top">I wish the places I usually photograph were so devoid of traffic! And I wish I could get my winshield clean :(</td>', 'I wish the places I usually photograph were so devoid of traffic! And I wish I could get my winshield clean :(', '2004-04-18 23:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(674402, 69160, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the view and the light, though the sun is a bit strong (and if you had used your top F-stop, you might have gotten a star effect here).  I think it might have been better to leave in less of the window frame--it''s a bit bold, and given it''s only on two sides, it might be better to downplay it in the image.</td>', 'I like the view and the light, though the sun is a bit strong (and if you had used your top F-stop, you might have gotten a star effect here).  I think it might have been better to leave in less of the window frame--it''s a bit bold, and given it''s only on two sides, it might be better to downplay it in the image.', '2004-04-18 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(674404, 69465, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, IMHOit might have been better to frame it in a single window.</td>', 'Interesting view, IMHOit might have been better to frame it in a single window.', '2004-04-18 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(674405, 68871, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the scene and the choice of B&amp;W   I think it would have benefited from a square perspective with the window frame.</td>', 'I like the scene and the choice of B&W   I think it would have benefited from a square perspective with the window frame.', '2004-04-18 23:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(674407, 69312, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice view; it might have been cool to square off the window frame; if it was a nice wood, you could have even framed it by providing a bit of inside light on it.  But in any case, the bottom light lip (and the bit at the top) probably should have been cropped.</td>', 'Nice view; it might have been cool to square off the window frame; if it was a nice wood, you could have even framed it by providing a bit of inside light on it.  But in any case, the bottom light lip (and the bit at the top) probably should have been cropped.', '2004-04-18 23:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(674409, 69355, 12253, '<td valign="top">The choice of including the inside frame + was good, but the flowers are very unbalanced in that composition IMHO (So few in the largest area).  Maybe there was a way to compose with an overall balance (or maybe not).</td>', 'The choice of including the inside frame + was good, but the flowers are very unbalanced in that composition IMHO (So few in the largest area).  Maybe there was a way to compose with an overall balance (or maybe not).', '2004-04-18 23:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(674410, 69467, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good use of the window for framing; nice light.  Might have been nice to block the sun further with that angled right frame.</td>', 'Good use of the window for framing; nice light.  Might have been nice to block the sun further with that angled right frame.', '2004-04-18 23:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(674418, 69236, 1031, '<td valign="top">Been there (on both sides of that window)!</td>', 'Been there (on both sides of that window)!', '2004-04-18 23:53:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(674419, 69094, 1031, '<td valign="top">Well, MY window doesn''t look quite like that!  :(</td>', 'Well, MY window doesn''t look quite like that!  :(', '2004-04-18 23:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(674421, 69582, 8610, '<td valign="top">Move closer to the wondow or tighter crop would make this picture alot better for me. Great scene outside</td>', 'Move closer to the wondow or tighter crop would make this picture alot better for me. Great scene outside', '2004-04-18 23:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(674422, 69308, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ve entered a shot similarly taken "from a window." Always remember to use the safety strap.</td>', 'I''ve entered a shot similarly taken "from a window." Always remember to use the safety strap.', '2004-04-18 23:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(674426, 69256, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the inside of a kaleidoscope -- very pretty colors.</td>', 'Reminds me of the inside of a kaleidoscope -- very pretty colors.', '2004-04-19 00:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(674429, 69644, 1031, '<td valign="top">Yeah, too bad.</td>', 'Yeah, too bad.', '2004-04-19 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(674432, 69505, 1031, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea -- might have taken out that light bit in the upper left (or burned it a bit darker) so it would seem to be taken from more behind the wheel. As it is, I find it a slight distraction.</td>', 'I really like this idea -- might have taken out that light bit in the upper left (or burned it a bit darker) so it would seem to be taken from more behind the wheel. As it is, I find it a slight distraction.', '2004-04-19 00:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(674434, 69671, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least that looks like a reasonable place to do that ... for maybe another 1.5 seconds!</td>', 'At least that looks like a reasonable place to do that ... for maybe another 1.5 seconds!', '2004-04-19 00:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(674447, 69556, 3724, '<td valign="top">good lighting and the cala lilies add a lot to this view</td>', 'good lighting and the cala lilies add a lot to this view', '2004-04-19 00:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(674448, 69618, 1031, '<td valign="top">I almost submitted something like this, but your''s is much better.</td>', 'I almost submitted something like this, but your''s is much better.', '2004-04-19 00:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(674451, 69510, 3724, '<td valign="top">nine......  colour may be off a bit but composition and use of long lens shows creativity in this</td>', 'nine......  colour may be off a bit but composition and use of long lens shows creativity in this', '2004-04-19 00:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(674472, 69618, 714, '<td valign="top">You voters with a little brain, suck!  Open your brains and let your imagination fly.  <br/> <br/>grrr...<br/> <br/>I love this shot and it is perfect for the challenge. <br/>Thanks to those who''s eyes were open to this shot.  (hug)<br/> <br/>Sonja</td>', 'You voters with a little brain, suck!  Open your brains and let your imagination fly.   grrr... I love this shot and it is perfect for the challenge. Thanks to those who''s eyes were open to this shot.  (hug) Sonja', '2004-04-19 01:11:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(674474, 69407, 3569, '<td valign="top">This was snow, our spring rain.  Where I live in Colorado, we get more snow on Easter than Christmas  (This was the day before Easter).  Thanks for the nice comments.  Van</td>', 'This was snow, our spring rain.  Where I live in Colorado, we get more snow on Easter than Christmas  (This was the day before Easter).  Thanks for the nice comments.  Van', '2004-04-19 01:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(674477, 69161, 14476, '<td valign="top">Frankly, this - given any justice - should have scored much higher.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Frankly, this - given any justice - should have scored much higher.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-04-19 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(674483, 69132, 16301, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for their great comments, I really appriciate it and i''m glad you liked the photo. Its nice to finish in the top 10.<br/> <br/>Good luck...<br/> <br/>- Thamer</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for their great comments, I really appriciate it and i''m glad you liked the photo. Its nice to finish in the top 10. Good luck... - Thamer', '2004-04-19 01:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(674488, 69673, 6477, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all for your comments. Yes, the silhouette was intentional but I didn''t get a good result I guess.<br/>Maya didn''t want to cooperate to much, it seems she smelled something in that side of the road...<br/></td>', 'Thank you to all for your comments. Yes, the silhouette was intentional but I didn''t get a good result I guess.Maya didn''t want to cooperate to much, it seems she smelled something in that side of the road...', '2004-04-19 01:19:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(674505, 69641, 2281, '<td valign="top">Thank you Paul...<br/> <br/>Yes the oversharpening is on purpose and I was trying to recreate a certain mood, I''m sorry... well not sorry per say, but there were a lot of people that didn''t pick up on it. Which is fine, I like the shot anyways.</td>', 'Thank you Paul... Yes the oversharpening is on purpose and I was trying to recreate a certain mood, I''m sorry... well not sorry per say, but there were a lot of people that didn''t pick up on it. Which is fine, I like the shot anyways.', '2004-04-19 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(674507, 69506, 9668, '<td valign="top">Congrats! 5th entry and you''ve already got a ribbon! Great Job!</td>', 'Congrats! 5th entry and you''ve already got a ribbon! Great Job!', '2004-04-19 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(674555, 69132, 6008, '<td valign="top">Bah, this should have scored much much higher!</td>', 'Bah, this should have scored much much higher!', '2004-04-19 01:42:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(674646, 69656, 6349, '<td valign="top">I thought this would do much better.  Excellent work.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'I thought this would do much better.  Excellent work.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-19 02:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(674649, 69624, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great work.  Thought this was yours.  Back to add this to my favorites.  Feel free to PM about that request I made during the challenge :)</td>', 'Great work.  Thought this was yours.  Back to add this to my favorites.  Feel free to PM about that request I made during the challenge :)', '2004-04-19 02:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
