(674835, 69624, 5728, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i> Great! This is one of my top scorers in this challenge!!! My fingers are crossed for you, if this doesn''t ribbon I will become a monk :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''ve sent my application away to the local monastery this morning :))<br/> <br/>I really wanted this to do better!</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness: Great! This is one of my top scorers in this challenge!!! My fingers are crossed for you, if this doesn''t ribbon I will become a monk :)   I''ve sent my application away to the local monastery this morning :)) I really wanted this to do better!', '2004-04-19 03:27:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(674849, 69677, 16230, '<td valign="top">Hey Tracy, from your portfolio it''s obvious that you''re a good photographer, so were you trying for a brown ribbon with this shot, or what? With all due respect, this is almost as bad as Jacko''s cat pic. :)<br/></td>', 'Hey Tracy, from your portfolio it''s obvious that you''re a good photographer, so were you trying for a brown ribbon with this shot, or what? With all due respect, this is almost as bad as Jacko''s cat pic. :)', '2004-04-19 03:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
