(675113, 69256, 16430, '<td valign="top">As several comments suggested, I did shoot a few images that kept the window frame in focus, but the results didn''t seem as good as this shot. Regardless, I''m quite pleased with my final score and thank everyone for their votes and the great comments.<br/> <br/></td>', 'As several comments suggested, I did shoot a few images that kept the window frame in focus, but the results didn''t seem as good as this shot. Regardless, I''m quite pleased with my final score and thank everyone for their votes and the great comments. ', '2004-04-19 07:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(675116, 69319, 12319, '<td valign="top">12th place, I have to admit to being rather pleased with that.<br/> <br/>Thank you for your votes and kind words.<br/> <br/>I thought it would be perceived as just another cat shot.<br/> <br/>I only took the one shot, and it wasn''t even mean''t for the challenge.<br/> <br/>p.s. I have now cleaned the window.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-13 05:22:38.</i></td>', '12th place, I have to admit to being rather pleased with that. Thank you for your votes and kind words. I thought it would be perceived as just another cat shot. I only took the one shot, and it wasn''t even mean''t for the challenge. p.s. I have now cleaned the window.', '2004-04-19 07:28:29.000000', '2004-07-13 06:22:38.000000', 0),
