(675161, 69518, 14614, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments (and for not getting on my case for being able to recognize my dog!)  My top ranked finish (12) to date!<br/> <br/>For JasonPR and the others who enjoyed the shot -- you''ve made my week (and it''s only Monday)!<br/> <br/>For the folks that didn''t think it was raining -- yup, quite heavily (check out the drops that show up on the top of her head) Not a picture of a picture but a picture of consentration.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments (and for not getting on my case for being able to recognize my dog!)  My top ranked finish (12) to date! For JasonPR and the others who enjoyed the shot -- you''ve made my week (and it''s only Monday)! For the folks that didn''t think it was raining -- yup, quite heavily (check out the drops that show up on the top of her head) Not a picture of a picture but a picture of consentration.', '2004-04-19 08:21:29.000000', NULL, 0),
