(676397, 69506, 16230, '<td valign="top">I actually like your original un-cropped photo better. It''s almost exactly the vision of the photo that I wanted to do for this challenge, but I couldn''t find a window sash to use. I was also lacking the beautiful beach sunset. :) Anyway, it''s a terrific photo and a well deserved ribbon. Congrats again.<br/> <br/>--Mick<br/></td>', 'I actually like your original un-cropped photo better. It''s almost exactly the vision of the photo that I wanted to do for this challenge, but I couldn''t find a window sash to use. I was also lacking the beautiful beach sunset. :) Anyway, it''s a terrific photo and a well deserved ribbon. Congrats again. --Mick', '2004-04-19 20:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
