(676578, 69506, 14193, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, like the idea totally. Take the window with you!!! :)<br/>Just a suggestion on the picture. Use ACDSee edit and increase the blackpoint just a bit. It makes the whole image clearer and increases the sillouette of the rocks. It is stunning that way, try it. And of course, cropping out the bit of sky at top will make the picture a definate 10. I love little edited images winning. I don''t like to edit mine too much, feels too much like computer graphics and not enough like genuine photograghy. But even old fashioned photograghers edited the pictures a little in the processing. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-19 21:42:47.</i></td>', 'Beautiful shot, like the idea totally. Take the window with you!!! :)Just a suggestion on the picture. Use ACDSee edit and increase the blackpoint just a bit. It makes the whole image clearer and increases the sillouette of the rocks. It is stunning that way, try it. And of course, cropping out the bit of sky at top will make the picture a definate 10. I love little edited images winning. I don''t like to edit mine too much, feels too much like computer graphics and not enough like genuine photograghy. But even old fashioned photograghers edited the pictures a little in the processing. ', '2004-04-19 22:42:06.000000', '2004-04-19 22:42:47.000000', 0),
