(676697, 69465, 8891, '<td valign="top">Seems to me you got un-necessarily slammed for this, Tom. Wow. I thought it would to a lot better....I liked it very much and give it a 9 just because of the clarity of the over all shot and the perfect reflection in the side view mirror which made the shot for me. I see some aberrations noted below but one, the kink in the tracks is caused by the curve of the window...jeez how hard is that to figure out. Another great job!   RoB</td>', 'Seems to me you got un-necessarily slammed for this, Tom. Wow. I thought it would to a lot better....I liked it very much and give it a 9 just because of the clarity of the over all shot and the perfect reflection in the side view mirror which made the shot for me. I see some aberrations noted below but one, the kink in the tracks is caused by the curve of the window...jeez how hard is that to figure out. Another great job!   RoB', '2004-04-20 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
