(680974, 69540, 4482, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to comment but this is an amazing window shot! The shadow of the person breaks the symetry and keeps your eye on the photo. I''m not a big fan of green tints but I don''t find it distracting here. Great job! My top of the challenge! :-)</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to comment but this is an amazing window shot! The shadow of the person breaks the symetry and keeps your eye on the photo. I''m not a big fan of green tints but I don''t find it distracting here. Great job! My top of the challenge! :-)', '2004-04-22 08:11:23.000000', NULL, 0),
